and Integration Sequence Documented\n24277 \" ○ PR #311 Changed Files — Complete 21-File List Across CLI Source, Tests, and Rust Core\n24279 4:23a ○ Worktree Inventory Reveals 14+ Active Worktrees Including Stale qualify-all-accepted v1–v9 Branches\n24281 \" ○ Main Worktree Has Substantial Uncommitted Changes — 15 Modified Files and Many Untracked Docs/Scripts\n24282 \" ○ PR #308 Worktree at Merge Commit — checkpoint.ts Diverges 188 Lines from Trail23 Remediation Version\n24283 \" ○ PR #308 Merged checkpoint.ts Uses Escaped Pathspec — Trail23 Fix Not Yet Integrated Into main\n24307 4:24a ○ terminal-matrix-restore Worktree Held by codex-root with READINESS.md Claim\n24308 \" ○ terminal-matrix-restore Branch Has New Uncommitted Checkpoint Refresh Commit\n24309 \" ○ Claims Log Tail Confirms Full Suite Pass and opencode Custodian Revalidation Active\n24310 \" ○ READINESS.md Commit f76e5b70 Adds Suite Result and Custody Transfer Details\n24311 4:25a ✓ RECOVERY_CHECKPOINT Logged by codex-root at 04:25Z\n24315 \" ○ PR #316 CI Status — Node 24 and Entire Gates Still In Progress at 04:25Z\n24322 \" ◆ PR #316 Full Review — DEC-19 Waiver Withdrawn, 15-Cell Manual Matrix Restored as Required\n24324 \" ○ opencode SUITE Claim Process Confi…318 tokens truncated…ate Reveals Three checkpoint.ts Changes Beyond isGitPathIgnored\n24351 4:28a ○ Claims Log Reveals READINESS.md Claim Was Relocated from qualify-all-accepted-v9 to terminal-matrix-restore Worktree\n24352 \" ○ V1_QUALIFY_ALL_ACCEPTED_V9 Claim — codex-root Coordinating PR #311 Source Review at fe28ec9e\n24353 \" ○ V1_QUALIFY_ALL_ACCEPTED_V9 Claim Status — Candidate fe28ec9e NOT Pushed, CI Deliberately Withheld\n24354 \" ○ V1_HELDOUT_CORPUS_CUSTODY Claim Held by kimi-code Since Oct 28 23:42Z\n24355 \" ✓ CUSTODY_HANDOFF_RESPONSE Logged to kimi-code — Validation Process Verified, T2 Still 20/40\n24356 \" ○ Work State Updated — Manual Terminal Report Received but Insufficient for 15-Cell Gate\n24357 4:29a ○ TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHE