{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:02:36.651Z","ordinal":490473,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a1885a-0892-71f0-82c2-682cd727a2e1","turn_id":"01a1885a-0892-71f0-82c2-682cd727a2e1","last_agent_message":"Confirmed. This is already recorded in `origin/main` at `14be4b8a2fc56c00e638bc7fd41eadcdf5aa91fd` as DEC-20:\n\n- The manual 5×3 matrix in §5.3 is **waived for v1.0.0**. It is neither passed nor outstanding.\n- Automated CI PTY (§5.1) and scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2) remain mandatory.\n- The waiver does not remove the other REQ-QUAL-108 checks.\n\nI left the dirty shared checkout untouched. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.","started_at":1793288964,"completed_at":1793289756,"duration_ms":792181,"time_to_first_token_ms":2867}}
