rtifact_code request committed its changes. Use the original page_id and ide\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_get_page_auto_update Read a Page's attached auto-update controller and whether you can enable or disable it. Page readers can see i\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_get_page_sharing Read a Page's sharing policy and your permissions. If the full roster is unavailable, the canonical owner can \nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_get_sharing_availability Check whether sharing management is enabled for the active account. If disabled, explain the restriction and s\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_inspect_page_reference Inspect an exact Page file reference before reading when its format or size is uncertain. Returns actor-author\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_list_page_automations List the canonical automations attached to an accessible Page, including its controller and workers. Read this\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_list_page_comments List collaborator comments and thread/message IDs for an accessible Page. Filter by block_id or open/resolved \nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_list_pages List accessible Pages, optionally within a Space. Results include document_type for native documents; omission\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_manage_page_comment For replies, prefer reply_page_comment. Add a block comment or anchor exact selected_text using its 1-based oc\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_move_page Move an existing Page beneath another Page or to the personal root only when requested. Read the relevant Spac\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_patch_page Replace literal text in existing Markdown blocks. Literal patches (patch_page and patch_block_markdown) requir\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_progress_update Show a short progress message at observed block IDs while working on an open Page. Ephemeral presence only; do\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_read_page Read an accessible Page's current content. Choose one read shape: {page_id}, {page_id,view:'full'}, {page_id,s\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_read_page_changes Read Page changes as markdown_diff with block IDs, hashes, actors and optional comments. Pass after_sequence f\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_read_page_reference Read an exact project-file:, library-file:, or visualize: reference from an accessible Page. Files independent\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_read_page_transcript Read the best available source transcript for a Page with namespace meeting_notes, including during recording.\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_reply_page_comment Post a reply to an existing Page comment thread. Use exact Page/thread IDs from prior reads. This only adds a \nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_run_page_auto_update Request a run of an enabled Page auto-update controller. Requires controller ownership and Page edit access. R\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_search_sharing_recipients Call get_sharing_availability first. If disabled, explain the account restriction and stop sharing management.\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_set_page_auto_update Enable or disable Page auto-update when necessary. Read get_page_auto_update first. With no controller, enabli"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18866-1ff5-7d90-876e-24d672df144c","create_time":1793289934.1753}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
