{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:18:31.591Z","ordinal":491096,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18871-74a8-7bc3-9805-31344cd738a3","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-d0f3883d-62d3-46fd-8725-76d7b8731ecc","server":"xerj","tool":"xerj_search","arguments":{"prefix":"goose","query":"scan filesystem recursively directories symlink traversal parallel","size":3,"max_tokens":1500},"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"_xerj\":{\"hints\":[{\"code\":\"lexical_on_semantic_text\",\"reason\":\"`text` is `semantic_text`, but this query scored it with BM25 over the analysed text — the embedding written at ingest was NOT consulted, so these hits are lexical and a paraphrase sharing no words with the target will not find it. For meaning-based recall run the `semantic` query on `text`; to keep both signals, combine them with `hybrid`.\",\"try\":{\"request\":\"POST /goose-*/_search\",\"body\":{\"query\":{\"semantic\":{\"field\":\"text\",\"query\":\"scan filesystem recursively directories symlink traversal parallel\",\"k\":10}}}}}]},\"took\":5454,\"timed_out\":false,\"_shards\":{\"total\":22,\"successful\":22,\"skipped\":0,\"failed\":0},\"hits\":{\"total\":{\"value\":734,\"relation\":\"eq\"},\"max_score\":55.784702,\"hits\":[{\"_index\":\"goose-docs\",\"_id\":\"663b61a868576b2634ef4dfbb1eef551\",\"_score\":55.784702,\"_source\":{\"title\":\"discovery.rs\",\"ax_path\":\"crates/goose-agent/src/skills/discovery.rs\",\"ax_file\":\"axf2-132be87e67d87ea5aa37ca0b911b1bad-1ef5\",\"ax_locator\":\"code\",\"language\":\"rust\"},\"fields\":{\"_passage\":[{\"field\":\"body\",\"ordinal\":194,\"start_offset\":5935,\"end_offset\":7924,\"text\":\"                                files.push(\\n                                    registered_skill_dir\\n                                        .join(relative)\\n                                        .to_string_lossy()\\n                                        .into_owned(),\\n                                );\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n                    },\\n                );\\n                source.supporting_files = files;\\n\\n                seen.insert(source.name.clone());\\n                sources.push(source);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    sources\\n}\\n\\n/// Recursively discovers skills from explicit roots, without consulting host configuration.\\n///\\n/// Roots are visited in input order. The first successfully parsed entry with a\\n/// given name wins; names are compared exactly and case-sensitively. Traversal\\n/// within each root is unsorted, so result order, duplicate-name winners within a\\n/// root, and supporting-file order are unspecified.\\n///\\n/// Discovery is best-effort: missing or unreadable directories and invalid or\\n/// unreadable skills are skipped. Some failures emit tracing warnings; no errors\\n/// are returned. An empty result does not distinguish no skills from a failed scan.\\n///\\n/// Traversal follows file and directory symlinks, including targets outside a\\n/// root. Canonical directory identities prevent cycles. `preserve_path` only\\n/// affects returned path spelling; discovery is not a confined file-open API.\\n/// The caller must enforce access policy when opening returned paths.\\npub fn discover_skills(roots: impl IntoIterator<Item = SkillRoot>) -> Vec<SourceEntry> {\\n    let mut sources: Vec<SourceEntry> = Vec::new();\\n    let mut seen = HashSet::new();\\n\\n    for dir in roots {\\n        for source in scan_skills_from_dir(\\n            &dir.path,\\n            dir.global,\\n            dir.writable,\\n            dir.preserve_path,\\n            &mut seen,\\n        ) {\\n            sources.push(source);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    sources\\n}\"}]},\"match_line\":215,\"match_lines\":[215,218,222,224,226]},{\"_index\":\"goose-docs\",\"_id\":\"834facdc29ae352870ebb77d0eb59ac1\",\"_score\":35.095306,\"_source\":{\"title\":\"thinking.rs\",\"ax_path\":\"crates/goose-cli/src/session/thinking.rs\",\"ax_file\":\"axf2-28a3969f3c8d134cbece3bf5abe35d76-1b21\",\"ax_locator\":\"code\",\"language\":\"rust\"},\"fields\":{\"_passage\":[{\"field\":\"body\",\"ordinal\":10,\"start_offset\":341,\"end_offset\":2380,\"text\":\"    \\\"Paddling through data\\\",\\n    \\\"Migrating thoughts\\\",\\n    \\\"Nesting ideas\\\",\\n    \\\"Squawking calculations\\\",\\n    \\\"Ruffling algorithmic feathers\\\",\\n    \\\"Pecking at problems\\\",\\n    \\\"Stretching webbed feet\\\",\\n    \\\"Foraging for solutions\\\",\\n    \\\"Grooming syntax\\\",\\n    \\\"Building digital nest\\\",\\n    \\\"Patrolling the codebase\\\",\\n    \\\"Gosling about\\\",\\n    \\\"Strutting with purpose\\\",\\n    \\\"Diving for answers\\\",\\n    \\\"Herding bytes\\\",\\n    \\\"Molting old code\\\",\\n    \\\"Swimming through streams\\\",\\n    \\\"Synchronizing flock algorithms\\\",\\n    \\\"Navigating code marshes\\\",\\n    \\\"Incubating brilliant ideas\\\",\\n    \\\"Arranging feathers recursively\\\",\\n    \\\"Gliding through branches\\\",\\n    \\\"Migrating to better solutions\\\",\\n    \\\"Nesting functions carefully\\\",\\n    \\\"Hatching clever solutions\\\",\\n    \\\"Preening parse trees\\\",\\n    \\\"Flying through functions\\\",\\n    \\\"Gathering syntax seeds\\\",\\n    \\\"Webbing connections\\\",\\n    \\\"Flocking to optimizations\\\",\\n    \\\"Paddling through protocols\\\",\\n    \\\"Honking success signals\\\",\\n    \\\"Waddling through workflows\\\",\\n    \\\"Nesting in neural networks\\\",\\n    \\\"Consulting the digital oracle\\\",\\n    \\\"Summoning binary spirits\\\",\\n    \\\"Reticulating splines\\\",\\n    \\\"Calculating meaning of life\\\",\\n    \\\"Traversing neural pathways\\\",\\n    \\\"Untangling spaghetti code\\\",\\n    \\\"Mining thought gems\\\",\\n    \\\"Defragmenting brain bits\\\",\\n    \\\"Compiling wisdom\\\",\\n    \\\"Debugging reality\\\",\\n    \\\"Optimizing thought processes\\\",\\n    \\\"Scanning parallel universes\\\",\\n    \\\"Reorganizing bits and bytes\\\",\\n    \\\"Calibrating neural networks\\\",\\n    \\\"Charging creativity cells\\\",\\n    \\\"Indexing imagination\\\",\\n    \\\"Parsing possibilities\\\",\\n    \\\"Buffering brilliance\\\",\\n    \\\"Loading clever responses\\\",\\n    \\\"Generating witty remarks\\\",\\n    \\\"Synthesizing solutions\\\",\\n    \\\"Applying machine learning\\\",\\n    \\\"Calculating quantum states\\\",\\n    \\\"Analyzing algorithms\\\",\\n    \\\"Decoding human intent\\\",\\n    \\\"Exploring solution space\\\",\\n    \\\"Gathering computational momentum\\\",\\n    \\\"Initializing clever mode\\\",\\n    \\\"Juggling variables\\\",\\n    \\\"Knitting neural networks\\\",\\n    \\\"Learning at light speed\\\",\\n    \\\"Navigating knowledge graphs\\\",\"}]},\"match_line\":31,\"match_lines\":[31,56]},{\"_index\":\"goose-docs\",\"_id\":\"4edb5faacf15f8dc3c6ddc218d735c24\",\"_score\":27.920616,\"_source\":{\"title\":\"directory\",\"ax_path\":\"crates/goose-roaming/src/lib.rs\",\"ax_file\":\"axf2-237d73521855a57c8defb96ae5ab6a7f-882\",\"ax_locator\":\"code:27:directory\",\"path\":\"lib.rs\",\"language\":\"rust\",\"kind\":\"module\",\"line\":27,\"code\":\"mod directory;\"}}]}}"}],"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":5,"nanos":600386819}},"started_at_ms":1793290705990,"completed_at_ms":1793290711590}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:18:32.676Z","ordinal":491097,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18874-b664-7321-8d71-18f226e50d80","call_id":"call_75e63f2ebf4949adbf164ea2053b851b","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 6.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"_xerj\\\":{\\\"hints\\\":[{\\\"code\\\":\\\"lexical_on_semantic_text\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"`text` is `semantic_text`, but this query scored it with BM25 over the analysed text — the embedding written at ingest was NOT consulted, so these hits are lexical and a paraphrase sharing no words with the target will not find it. For meaning-based recall run the `semantic` query on `text`; to keep both signals, combine them with `hybrid`.\\\",\\\"try\\\":{\\\"request\\\":\\\"POST /goose-*/_search\\\",\\\"body\\\":{\\\"query\\\":{\\\"semantic\\\":{\\\"field\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"scan filesystem recursively directories symlink traversal parallel\\\",\\\"k\\\":10}}}}}]},\\\"took\\\":5454,\\\"timed_out\\\":false,\\\"_shards\\\":{\\\"total\\\":22,\\\"successful\\\":22,\\\"skipped\\\":0,\\\"failed\\\":0},\\\"hits\\\":{\\\"total\\\":{\\\"value\\\":734,\\\"relation\\\":\\\"eq\\\"},\\\"max_score\\\":55.784702,\\\"hits\\\":[{\\\"_index\\\":\\\"goose-docs\\\",\\\"_id\\\":\\\"663b61a868576b2634ef4dfbb1eef551\\\",\\\"_score\\\":55.784702,\\\"_source\\\":{\\\"title\\\":\\\"discovery.rs\\\",\\\"ax_path\\\":\\\"crates/goose-agent/src/skills/discovery.rs\\\",\\\"ax_file\\\":\\\"axf2-132be87e67d87ea5aa37ca0b911b1bad-1ef5\\\",\\\"ax_locator\\\":\\\"code\\\",\\\"language\\\":\\\"rust\\\"},\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"_passage\\\":[{\\\"field\\\":\\\"body\\\",\\\"ordinal\\\":194,\\\"start_offset\\\":5935,\\\"end_offset\\\":7924,\\\"text\\\":\\\"                                files.push(\\\\n                                    registered_skill_dir\\\\n                                        .join(relative)\\\\n                                        .to_string_lossy()\\\\n                                        .into_owned(),\\\\n                                );\\\\n                            }\\\\n                        }\\\\n                    },\\\\n                );\\\\n                source.supporting_files = files;\\\\n\\\\n                seen.insert(source.name.clone());\\\\n                sources.push(source);\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n    }\\\\n    sources\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n/// Recursively discovers skills from explicit roots, without consulting host configuration.\\\\n///\\\\n/// Roots are visited in input order. The first successfully parsed entry with a\\\\n/// given name wins; names are compared exactly and case-sensitively. Traversal\\\\n/// within each root is unsorted, so result order, duplicate-name winners within a\\\\n/// root, and supporting-file order are unspecified.\\\\n///\\\\n/// Discovery is best-effort: missing or unreadable directories and invalid or\\\\n/// unreadable skills are skipped. Some failures emit tracing warnings; no errors\\\\n/// are returned. An empty result does not distinguish no skills from a failed scan.\\\\n///\\\\n/// Traversal follows file and directory symlinks, including targets outside a\\\\n/// root. Canonical directory identities prevent cycles. `preserve_path` only\\\\n/// affects returned path spelling; discovery is not a confined file-open API.\\\\"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18871-74a8-7bc3-9805-31344cd738a3","create_time":1793290712.6765788}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
