kpoint (2026-10-29 16:28 UTC)\n\n- **Authoritative source:** `origin/main` is `7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760`, the PR #326 merge for the `libz-sys` advisory update. `origin/v1/integration` remains `7d6673f108316dda015b858c85b2abe20f3a4f78`; release evidence below is assessed against `main`, not combined across these revisions.\n- **Source gates:** CI run [40910552951](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40910552951) is still running on exact `7fad87d`; Node 22 and Node 24 have completed setup, version synchronization, requirements checking, CLI build, Rust tests, and release-core build, and are running `npm --prefix cli test`. Exact-head CodeQL run [40910552720](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40910552720) passed. The CI run has no final matrix conclusion yet. A clean isolated worktree at this revision passes `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC rows remain deferred) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` (all components `1.0.0-rc.11`).\n- **PR #318 evaluator remediation:** PR #318 remains open at `1682dcb325cea7078e193d0ed0b5af5325ce8ca8`, based on `14be4b8a2fc56c00e638bc7fd41eadcdf5aa91fd`, which is behind current `main`. Its exact-head run [40903691542](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40903691542) failed Node 22 and Node 24 in fail-closed compiler-exposure preflight after inventory timeout; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, Linux was skipped, and Entire Gates failed. The separate full `make test` run on exact `1682dcb` remains active in its claimed immutable worktree; no local full-suite outcome is inferred. The owner is preparing an uncommitted parallel-root inventory scanner fix; independent review found a shutdown-bound defect in that patch, and the fix and focused/full validation remain pending. No held-out tasks were used.\n- **PR #325:** The RC10 E2 closeout remains open at `4c8afc0b99d819620fe00875da5548dbcfad9c3e` on base `7fad87d`. Its JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL checks pass; Node 22, Node 24, and Entire Gates were pending at this checkpoint. Its evidence is specific to the historical RC10 artifact and does not qualify RC11.\n- **Terminal disposition:** The manual five-terminal by three-size matrix in §5.3 is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20, which supersedes withdrawn DEC-19. No manual cells are claimed as passed or required. Automated §5.1 CI PTY and scripted installed-RC §5.2 remain mandatory. Historical RC10 scripted PTY evidence is `PARTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED` (including a 27.89-second cancellation idle outlier), and its accessibility evidence is also partial; it does not establish the required gates for a later RC.\n- **RC and product qualification:** The latest public prerelease is `v1.0.0-rc.10`, built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`; `v1.0.0-rc.11` is not published. T2/T3 custody acceptance and qualification, T4, exact-RC provider and standalone matrices, exact-RC cross-runner reproducibility, long-task qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) is open and unassigned; no fresh custodian acceptance or qualification run is recorded, and no private payload was accessed.\n- **Disposition:** Campaign `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Publication authorization remains granted but gated by exact-RC acceptance and final artifact verification.\n\nLocal test files:\n\nBranch diff:\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1887a-3678-7eb0-a65c-0231eb513ce7","create_time":1793291730.3285658}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
