or fails preflight (3115.45033ms)\\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.421402ms)\\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.926044ms)\\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.288377ms)\\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.920441ms)\\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (1146.732453ms)\\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (7.273756ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1887a-3678-7eb0-a65c-0231eb513ce7","create_time":1793292285.7391431}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
