{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:45:35.160Z","ordinal":492438,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1887a-3678-7eb0-a65c-0231eb513ce7","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-44e86868-52a1-43fe-926d-1e43122a13bb","process_id":"1385","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","env HOME=\"$PWD/t/home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$PWD/t/config\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\"$PWD/t/cache\" TMPDIR=\"$PWD/t/tmp\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_hardened.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"env HOME=\"$PWD/t/home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$PWD/t/config\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\"$PWD/t/cache\" TMPDIR=\"$PWD/t/tmp\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_hardened.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ runAsAclArgs scopes evaluator and operator permissions with directory defaults (24.023586ms)\n✔ asUserSpec preserves timeout metadata and isolated processes reject missing timeouts (19.809057ms)\n✔ test infrastructure is recognised across Python, Go, JS/TS and Rust layouts (18.348447ms)\n✔ hidden test staging preserves workspace files and mounts only copied hidden files (10.16908ms)\n✔ Python oracle preload keeps saved source out of module globals and sys.path (89.923657ms)\n✔ pytest candidate imports cannot inspect hidden Python sources (2964.030768ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (10.118202ms)\n✔ only the agent's source changes reach the fresh check workspace; adversarial workspace state never does (23.6756ms)\n✔ manifest changes outside plain dependency and metadata edits refuse the checks (4.986881ms)\n✔ a heldout-v2 manifest binds each selected task's task.json and hidden directory (17.158091ms)\n✔ hardened checks: a correct change passes in a fresh workspace; a test-script change refuses the checks (23960.673084ms)\n✔ hardened checks hide oracle source from candidate code and reject empty-output commands (11833.540058ms)\n✔ test data, symlinked paths, new Python packages, oversized files and manifest deletions never weaken the checks (29.358335ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (8.892722ms)\n✔ Go and Rust hidden sources are absent during build audits and test execution (22491.7791ms)\n✔ manifest guards fail closed on TOML headers they do not recognise, go.mod blocks and new manifests (7.186576ms)\n✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (168.963721ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (25.709996ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (27.156881ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (54.245329ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (27.745878ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (12.527265ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (132.520789ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (85.337302ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (629.09486ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (34.987447ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (2.175622ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (359.479576ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (3115.45033ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.421402ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.926044ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.288377ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.920441ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (1146.732453ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (7.273756ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (28085.514748ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (3219.283487ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (4859.470813ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (2549.570688ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (7.97696ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (23.131084ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (9479.797723ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (1623.008346ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (8.60121ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (495.083735ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (104.026745ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (6.511987ms)\nℹ tests 47\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 47\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 118527.114896\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":119,"nanos":745945854}},"started_at_ms":1793292215409,"completed_at_ms":1793292335156}}
