{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:49:38.366Z","ordinal":492559,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1888f-e991-7d30-9330-bb330592dfef","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a1888f-e991-7d30-9330-bb330592dfef","response_id":"resp_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae37920990481a08587953daecaf185","usage":{"input_tokens":174401,"cached_input_tokens":173696,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":112,"reasoning_output_tokens":72,"total_tokens":174513},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1192687,"cached_input_tokens":1182720,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2160,"reasoning_output_tokens":1191,"total_tokens":1194847},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":9133146472,"cached_input_tokens":9033955840,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":26177374,"reasoning_output_tokens":15181152,"total_tokens":9159323846}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:49:38.386Z","ordinal":492560,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18891-2e52-7cd0-a7ec-7b06478a33f2","call_id":"call_2dc29ba414f149d9b5612833b5624648","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Full-text search over subject and body for a project.\n\nTips\n----\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\"build plan\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\n- Results are ordered by bm25 score (best matches first)\n- Limit defaults to 20; raise for broad queries\n\nQuery examples\n---------------\n- Phrase search: `\"build plan\"`\n- Prefix: `migrat*`\n- Boolean: `plan AND users`\n- Require urgent: `urgent AND deployment`\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nquery : str\n    FTS5 query string.\nlimit : int\n    Max results to return.\n\nReturns\n-------\nlist[dict]\n    Each entry: { id, subject, importance, ack_required, created_ts, thread_id, from }\n\nExample\n-------\n```json\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"10\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"search_messages\",\"arguments\":{\n  \"project_key\":\"/abs/path/backend\",\"query\":\"\"build plan\" AND users\", \"limit\": 50\n}}}\n```\n\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages(args: { agent_name?: string | null; format?: string | null; limit?: number; project_key: string; query: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1888f-e991-7d30-9330-bb330592dfef","create_time":1793292578.3862026}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
