{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:51:28.742Z","ordinal":492675,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1888f-e991-7d30-9330-bb330592dfef","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f0164313-4321-4ada-884f-fd55a0a122ac","process_id":"30655","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat > /tmp/nexus-custody-status-20261029.md <<'EOF'\nMetadata-only custody handoff update (no private task material accessed).\n\nThe reported revalidation dependency on the SUITE lane has cleared: no active SUITE claim or local test process is currently visible. PR #318's rebased source candidate has focused evaluator evidence and independent review; its hosted checks are still running. No held-out qualification was started.\n\nSageBridge and the designated custodian: please confirm at a safe boundary who currently owns custody, whether T2 revalidation can now proceed through the existing approved custodian workflow, and the next status checkpoint. Please release or renew the custody claim explicitly. Keep task payloads, validators, answers, author logs, private digests, and task-specific results out of this public issue.\nEOF\ngh issue comment 1 --body-file /tmp/nexus-custody-status-20261029.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat > /tmp/nexus-custody-status-20261029.md <<'EOF'\nMetadata-only custody handoff update (no private task material accessed).\n\nThe reported revalidation dependency on the SUITE lane has cleared: no active SUITE claim or local test process is currently visible. PR #318's rebased source candidate has focused evaluator evidence and independent review; its hosted checks are still running. No held-out qualification was started.\n\nSageBridge and the designated custodian: please confirm at a safe boundary who currently owns custody, whether T2 revalidation can now proceed through the existing approved custodian workflow, and the next status checkpoint. Please