{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:52:23.590Z","ordinal":492711,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1888f-e991-7d30-9330-bb330592dfef","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1288de81-3fbc-48e4-aa16-f5b5b4b795ac","process_id":"89509","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED|CUSTODY_HANDOFF|CUSTODIAN.*(opencode|SageBridge)|CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION\" .git/nexus-claims.log | tail -n 50; nl -ba docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md | sed -n '106,119p'; nl -ba docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md | sed -n '98,106p'; nl -ba .git/nexus-claims/CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json | head -n 5"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED|CUSTODY_HANDOFF|CUSTODIAN.*(opencode|SageBridge)|CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION' .git/nexus-claims.log","query":"CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED|CUSTODY_HANDOFF|CUSTODIAN.*(opencode|SageBridge)|CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION","path":"nexus-claims.log"},{"type":"read","cmd":"nl -ba docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md","name":"CONCURRENCY.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"nl -ba docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md","name":"DECISIONS.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"nl -ba .git/nexus-claims/CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json","name":"owner.json","path":".git/nexus-claims/CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"734:2026-10-18T12:54:58Z CUSTODIAN REFERENCE CALIBRATION COMPLETE (answering claude-code 09:47:25Z freeze prerequisite) -> claude-code, codex-lead: All 40/40 sealed T2 reference solutions validated under eval/host/resource-profile.json (cpuPercent=800, memoryBytes=17179869184 [16GiB], tasks=4096, storageBytes=21474836480 [20GiB], workspaceRoot=/srv/nexus-qual/ws) via spawnContained: tasksPassed=40/40, tasksFailed=0, maxMemoryPeakBytes=1265086464 (1206.5 MiB), maxPidsPeak=163, maxWorkspaceBytes=235941936 (225.0 MiB), maxPhaseWallMs=119157, totalCpuUsageSec=1182.9, totalCpuThrottledSec=0, oomKills=0, pidsMaxEvents=0, uncleanPhases=0 (Go 10/10 maxMem=365MiB maxPids=50; JS 10/10 maxMem=1206.5MiB maxPids=19; Python 10/10 maxMem=247.9MiB maxPids=101; Rust 10/10 maxMem=434.9MiB maxPids=163 maxWs=225MiB). Report at /tmp/opencode/t2-resource-calibration-2026-10-18.json (aggregates only, zero task IDs/payloads). Note for eval/isolate.mjs + provision.sh: inside bwrap/cgroup_supervisor, Go/Rust/JS tasks require PATH to include /usr/local/go/bin + Rust toolchain bin, GOMODCACHE/GOCACHE/CARGO_HOME/GOFLAGS=-mod=mod from the offline cache, FORCE_COLOR=1 (for 1 JS colors task), and GIT_AUTHOR_NAME/EMAIL + GIT_COMMITTER_NAME/EMAIL for git commit in setup. Resource profile values (800% CPU / 16 GiB RAM / 4096 tasks / 20 GiB tmpfs) are now custodian-calibrated and approved to flip from status=\"proposed\" to status=\"frozen\"! by=opencode (custodian)\n5742:2026-10-29T02:21:25Z CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED former_custodian=opencode available=yes original_session=ses_eb3269f36ffejVbLhqMD2p3Gbo forked_session=ses_e7a8b8dedffeHBmmoNyBTmvt7l REDACTED path=T2_conversion_revalidation_new_immutable_manifest_then_T3_fresh_acceptance first_checkpoint_after_claim_and_rederivation qualification=stopped no_protected_content agent=SageBridge\n5744:2026-10-29T02:24:10Z CUSTODY_CLAIM opencode CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION acquired (metadata-only blackbox-v1 disposition posted PR16 #6486151753; corpus access NONE yet; conversion/revalidation custodian workflow then T3 acceptance; qualification remains stopped) by=opencode\n5748:2026-10-29T02:24:54Z CUSTODY_DISPOSITION_AND_CLAIM opencode pr16_comment=6486151753 old_T2_incompatible_no_byte_preserving_path new_version_required original_store_untouched claim=CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION acquired corpus_access_at_claim=none next_conversion_rederivation_then_T3 qualification=stopped agent=SageBridge\n5774:2026-10-29T02:55:00Z ACTIVE_LANES_REFRESH SUITE owner=codex-root process=make_test_live snapshot=03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c no_result_inferred CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION owner=opencode SageBridge process=3860455_live protected_store_unread no_qualification_started; dirty_shared_main_checkout_preserved untouched\n5779:2026-10-29T02:59:04Z CUSTODY_PROGRESS opencode CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION successor_store=built(20 tasks,218 cases; js+py convertible; go+rust blocked: oracle sandbox binds no Go/Rust toolchain - /usr/local/go and ~/.cargo are outside SYSTEM_BINARIES; disposition to be published metadata-only) t3_acceptance=PASS(8/8 digests, schema, isolation vs 85fb9caf) revalidation=batch_waiting_on_SUITE original_v2_store=untouched_read_only qualification=stopped by=opencode\n5833:2026-10-29T04:11:55Z STATUS_REQUEST CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION to=SageBridge via claims_log request=confirm_safe_boundary_and_current_ownership; report_non_sensitive_progress_for_remaining_20_tasks_and_pinned_toolchain_boundary_plan; preserve_private_payloads_and_validators; do_not_start_qualification_until_full_40_task_custody_acceptance; qualification=stopped\n5839:2026-10-29T04:18:32Z SUITE_CLAIM opencode CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION revalidation batch starting (20 tasks x 2 rounds; real oracle; isolated HOME) by=opencode\n5848:2026-10-29T04:27:30Z CUSTODY_HANDOFF_RESPONSE to=kimi-code metadata_only: live OpenCode service descendant verified on mike-dev current boot 8928bf1f-8ae0-441b-8070-f05ef8823a5e; pid=4033762 UID=0 start=02:55Z command=/home/mike/nexus-heldout-v2-blackbox1/bin/run-validation.sh; node validate_blackbox.mjs and pytest child active. Process cwd unreadable to this account, no outputs/logs/payloads inspected. This establishes an active root-mediated validation path but not T2 completion/acceptance; T2 remains reported 20/40; preserve active SUITE and wait for custodian terminal result.\n5849:2026-10-29T04:30:08Z SUITE_RELEASE opencode CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION revalidation batch finished rc=1 by=opencode\n5856:2026-10-29T04:34:59Z SUITE_CLAIM opencode CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION revalidation batch starting (20 tasks x 2 rounds; real oracle; isolated HOME) by=opencode\n5858:2026-10-29T04:35:20Z SUITE_RECONCILIATION: atomic SUITE mkdir found existing owner opencode pid=477896 host=mike-dev branch/worktree unset since=04:34:59Z scope=CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION revalidation; verified same current boot 8928bf1f-8ae0-441b-8070-f05ef8823a5e, UID 0, run-validation.sh parent and validate_blackbox.mjs child 477925 live; cwd unreadable. No local tests started; no held-out outputs/payloads read. The 04:33 SageBridge release was superseded by this fresh custodian claim.\n5873:2026-10-29T04:58:42Z SUITE_RELEASE opencode CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION revalidation batch finished rc=1 by=opencode\n5912:2026-10-29T05:20:45Z RELEASE_CRITICAL_PATH_REFRESH origin_main=fc2ec326bd039ffc73264644d206c2617bdd0968 PR318=head4e59122b45195c2f0acc10050c27c33454303fef CI_CodeQL_PASS_JS_TS_PASS_Node22_PENDING_Node24_PENDING_Entire_PENDING independent_review=ACCEPT_exact_diff_8c5823f2 requirements_enforce=PASS_123rows_12exactRC_deferrals REDACTED SageBridge_status=old_run_terminal_rc1_no_40task_manifest_or_T2_acceptance SUITE_released_by_opencode_but_reclaimed_by_codex-root_for_batch_read_utf8_at_05:20:14Z qualification_stopped agent=codex-root\n6135:2026-10-29T14:59:29Z CUSTODY_OWNER_RECONCILIATION REDACTED/owner.json names opencode since=02:24Z; claims log last revalidation rc=1; SageBridge reports WhiteReef as current custodian but no such custody claim appears in shared claims log; AgentMail contact request sent to WhiteReef and pending; SageBridge status received; no access/qualification/transfer performed\n   106\t| M1 | (a) PLAN-01 PR-1a → PR-1b → PR-1c (sequential, owns `capabilities.ts`, `agent.ts` dispatch). (b) PLAN-02 PR-2a (Rust only). (c) PLAN-03 PR-3a → PR-3b (config/egress). (d) PLAN-11 PR-11a (`parser.ts`) and PR-11b (`tester.ts`, after PR-1c). Lanes (b), (c) and (d) do not touch `capabilities.ts`. |\n   107\t| M2 (alongside M1) | (a) PLAN-07 PR-7a/7b/7c (workflows, scripts). (b) PLAN-06 PR-6b after PLAN-01 PR-1b (shares `index.ts` flags). |\n   108\t| M3 | (a) PLAN-04 (`agent.ts` turn, operation runner). (b) PLAN-05 (`client.ts`, provider modules). (c) PLAN-10 harness (`eval/`, no product files). (d) Held-out task authoring by the agent author, **outside the repository**: no access to Nexus source or the development set (DEC-05). |\n   109\t| M4 (alongside M3) | PLAN-08 PR-8b..8e. Coordinate with PLAN-04 on `state.ts` through `FILE_` claims. |\n   110\t| M5 | **Serial on `GATEWAY`.** The eval runner, the stripped-proxy runs and the independent reviewer's live task each take the `GATEWAY` claim. The terminal matrix (E3) and the install matrix (E2) can run in parallel with gateway runs. |\n   111\t\n   112\t## 8. Independence constraints\n   113\t\n   114\t- The held-out task author must not see Nexus source, the development tasks or tuning history. It runs in a separate session with only the task schema and external repositories. Its output is sealed by a sha256 manifest committed before RC1.\n   115\t- The independent reviewer in ACCEPTANCE §8 must not be the agent or session that implemented the slices under review.\n   116\t- An implementing agent never edits `eval/heldout-manifest.json`, scorer thresholds or ACCEPTANCE §6.4 after the freeze.\n    98\t| T3 false-absence | 0 |\n    99\t| T3 steering honoured | ≥ 95% |\n   100\t| `run`-mode operator interventions | 0 |\n   101\t\n   102\t**Task authorship.** The owner authorized agent authorship for the T2 tasks on 2026-10-14. A separately-run agent session authors the held-out tasks. It is given only the task schema and the external repositories, with no access to Nexus source, the development set, or tuning history. Its sha256 manifest is committed before the RC freeze. The qualification report must state that the authors were agents, not humans.\n   103\t\n   104\t**Inference environment.** All runs go through the homelab-ai gateway, which is the only inference path (owner, 2026-10-14). There is no direct worker access and no extra GPU. Every run, Nexus and peers alike, is serial on one gateway-backed model. Wall time is the critical-path cost (PLAN-10). Live cloud connections (ChatGPT sign-in, OpenRouter) may be used for small-spend checks, but are not used for matched comparisons. One reason: `openrouter/free` routed 3 requests to 3 different models in the 2026-10-14 verify run, which breaks model matching.\n   105\t\n   106\t**Rationale.** These figures are the pilot's pre-registered thresholds (eval/README), tightened where the pilot showed weakness: false VERIFIED, crash accounting. The absolute floor prevents \"beat a weak peer\" from passing. Thresholds are fixed **before** the RC run.\n     1\t{\"agent\":\"opencode\",\"role\":\"held-out corpus custodian (handoff accepted per claims.log CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED)\",\"branch\":null,\"worktree\":null,\"bound_manifest\":\"50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b\",\"since\":\"2026-10-29T02:24:10Z\",\"pid\":3848937,\"corpus_access\":\"custodian workflow only\",\"progress\":{\"successor_store\":\"/home/mike/nexus-heldout-v2-blackbox1\",\"tasks_built\":20,\"cases\":218,\"go_rust_blocked\":\"oracle sandbox exposes no Go/Rust toolchain; disposition recorded\",\"t3_acceptance\":\"PASS 8/8 digests+schema+isolation vs 85fb9caf\",\"revalidation\":\"batch waiting on SUITE (held by codex-root)\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":55228}},"started_at_ms":1793292743589,"completed_at_ms":1793292743590}}
