l/reference/mutations#\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_create_pull_request\",\"description\":\"Open a pull request in the repository. Returns the connector's normalized PR snapshot, not the full REST response payload. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/pulls/pulls?apiVers\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_dismiss_pull_request_review\",\"description\":\"Dismiss a submitted pull request review. Returns the normalized review snapshot after dismissal. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/mutations#dismisspullrequestrevi\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_download_user_content\",\"description\":\"Download a GitHub private user image attachment URL. Use this only for private-user-images.githubusercontent.com URLs, such as GitHub issue or pull request image uploads. Use fetch\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_enable_auto_merge\",\"description\":\"Enable auto-merge for a pull request. This wrapper infers the merge method from repository settings and returns only `success`. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/m\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch\",\"description\":\"Fetch approved public GitHub repository resources and repository files. Supports repositories, directories, code and issue search, and blob or raw file URLs. Pull requests, issues,\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_commit_workflow_runs\",\"description\":\"Fetch GitHub Actions workflow runs associated with a commit SHA. This wrapper currently filters to pull-request-triggered runs and returns the first page only. Docs: https://docs.g\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_issue\",\"description\":\"Fetch a GitHub issue. You must populate exactly one of `repository_full_name`, `repository_id`, or `repository_url` to select the issue's repository. This tool is part of plugin `G\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_pr\",\"description\":\"Fetch a pull request with its diff, metadata, and optionally comments. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some feat\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_pr_comments\",\"description\":\"Fetch a merged PR discussion timeline. The returned list combines issue comments, inline review comments, and review submissions into one normalized array. Docs: https://docs.githu\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_pr_file_patch\",\"description\":\"Fetch the patch for one validated changed file in an accessible pull request. Call `list_pr_changed_filenames` first, then pass an exact returned path. A valid pull request that do\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_pr_patch\",\"description\":\"Fetch the patch for a GitHub pull request across all changed-file pages. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some fe\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_get_pr_diff\",\"description\":\"Fetch just the diff or patch text for a pull request. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Code\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_get_pr_info\",\"description\":\"Get metadata (title, description, refs, and status) for a pull request. This action does *not* include the actual code changes. If you need the diff or per-file patches, call `fetc\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_get_pr_reactions\",\"description\":\"Fetch reactions for a GitHub pull request. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\\n\\nexec too\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_get_pr_review_comment_reactions\",\"description\":\"Fetch reactions for a pull request review comment. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_get_repo\",\"description\":\"Retrieve meta