ub pull requests globally, by organization, or optionally by repository. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_unlock_issue_conversation\",\"description\":\"Unlock an issue or pull request conversation. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/issues/issues?apiVersion=2022-11-28#unlock-an-issue. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\nAcce\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_unresolve_review_thread\",\"description\":\"Mark an inline pull request review thread as unresolved. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/mutations#unresolvereviewthread. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_update_pull_request\",\"description\":\"Update PR metadata, base branch, or open/closed state. Returns the connector's normalized PR snapshot. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/pulls/pulls?apiVersion=2022-11-28#updat\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message\",\"description\":\"Acknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Sets both read_ts and ack_ts for the (agent, message) pairing\\n- Safe to call multiple times; su\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project\",\"description\":\"Soft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\\n\\nYou are th\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity\",\"description\":\"Create a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nHow this differs from `register_agent`\\n--------------------------------------\\n- Always creates a new identity w\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\",\"description\":\"Remove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer se\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\",\"description\":\"Idempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\\n- As a guard befor\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window\",\"description\":\"Mark a window identity as expired.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\\n\\nReturns\\n------\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\",\"description\":\"Retrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilters\\n-------\\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 time\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"Retrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic\",\"description\":\"Fetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\ntopic_name : str\\n    The topic tag\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths\",\"description\":\"Request advisory file reservations (leases) on project-relative paths/globs.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- Conflicts are reported if an overlapping active exclusive reservation exists hel\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation\",\"description\":\"Force-release a stale file reservation held by another agent after inactivity heuristics.\\n\\nThe tool validates that the reservation appears abandoned (agent inactive beyond threshol\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent\",\"description\":\"IRREVERSIBLY delete an agent and ALL associated data: messages sent by the agent, message recipient records, file reservations, agent links, window identities, and on-disk archive \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project\",\"description\":\"IRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling suggestion, \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check\",\"description\":\"Return basic readiness information for the Agent Mail server.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard\",\"description\":\"Install the Agent Mail pre-commit guard into a git repository.\\n\\nThe guard blocks a commit that stages files another agent holds an\\nexclusive file reservation on (set ``AGENT_MAIL_G\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\",\"description\":\"List contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating age\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"description\":\"List active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake\",\"description\":\"Request contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling,\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle\",\"description\":\"Reserve a set of file paths and optionally release them at the end of the workflow.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread\",\"description\":\"Macro helper that aligns an agent with an existing thread by ensuring registration,\\nsummarising the thread, and fetching recent inbox context.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordinat\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session\",\"description\":\"Macro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coord\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read\",\"description\":\"Mark a specific message as read for the given agent.\\n\\nNotes\\n-----\\n- Read receipts are per-recipient; this only affects the specified agent.\\n- This does not send an acknowledgement;\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages\",\"description\":\"Delete messages older than the configured retention period. Defaults to retention_max_age_days from config (180 days). Returns count of messages purged.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\",\"description\":\"Create or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\\n- To update \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations\",\"description\":\"Release active file reservations held by an agent.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- If both `paths` and `file_reservation_ids` are omitted, all active reservations for the agent are released\\n-\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window\",\"description\":\"Update the display name of a window identity.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to rename.\\nnew_\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__renew_file_reservations\",\"description\":\"Extend expiry for active file reservations held by an agent without reissuing them.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : str\\n    Age\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message\",\"description\":\"Reply to an existing message, preserving or establishing a thread.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Inherits original `importance` and `ack_required` flags\\n- `thread_id` is taken from the orig\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact\",\"description\":\"Request contact approval to message another agent.\\n\\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover availa\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact\",\"description\":\"Approve or deny a contact request.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Output\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent\",\"description\":\"Soft-delete an agent: mark it as retired so it stops accepting new messages while preserving message history. Retired agents are hidden from active agent lists but visible in 'all \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages\",\"description\":\"Full-text search over subject and body for a project.\\n\\nTips\\n----\\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\\\"build plan\\\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\\n- Results are order\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\",\"description\":\"Send a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resou\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy\",\"description\":\"Set contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and projec\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_recent\",\"description\":\"Summarize all recent project messages within a time window.\\n\\nFetches messages from the last ``since_hours`` hours, groups them by\\nthread, and produces a combined project-wide summa\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread\",\"description\":\"Extract participants, key points, and action items for one or more threads.\\n\\nSingle-thread mode (thread_id is a single ID):\\n- Returns detailed summary with optional example message\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__sweep_stale_agents\",\"description\":\"Retire abandoned agents in the caller's project using the server's conservative inactivity heuristic. The caller is never retired, the threshold has a 60-second floor, and active f\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project\",\"description\":\"Restore an archived project back to active status.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperatin\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard\",\"description\":\"Remove the Agent Mail commit guards from a git repository.\\n\\nRemoves Agent Mail's own pre-commit and pre-push guard plugins (and a\\nlegacy single-file Agent Mail hook); other hooks i\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_ag…2788 tokens truncated…in eval_hardened compiler exposure preflight, including Go/Rust hidden-source test; fail-closed error at eval/isolate.mjs:461 after ~30s scan; no acceptance or threshold relaxation. Local exact-head SUITE claim remains live (make PID=3682481, npm PID=3697946); FILE_eval_isolate.mjs claim remains with KimiCode-defect-scan and was not altered. Coordinator requests owner safe-boundary response/remediation status.\n2026-10-29T16:09:48Z RC10_SCRIPTED_PTY_EVIDENCE_RECHECK observed_worktree=/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v7 head=f11ef5c17348e5b1215f0feaad3ac572acffb896 candidate=v1.0.0-rc.10 source=16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0 archive_sha256=444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d9