{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:56:17.198Z","ordinal":492900,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae37aae936c81a083bb703798286b55","status":"completed","call_id":"call_204e32561d174cbbae9ec58dc59674cf","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc11-dec20-release-notes/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.11.md\\n@@\\n-- Readiness, terminal and qualification records were refreshed through 2026-10-29. The manual real-terminal matrix is **required** for v1.0.0; the earlier matrix-waiver record was withdrawn (DEC-19). Screenshot artifacts alone are waived (DEC-18).\\n+- Readiness, terminal and qualification records were refreshed through 2026-10-29. The manual five-terminal by three-size matrix (§5.3) is **waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20**: no operator runs, cell verdicts, or per-cell evidence are required or claimed. The automated CI PTY gate (§5.1) and scripted installed-RC PTY gate (§5.2) remain mandatory. The separate screenshot-artifact waiver is recorded in DEC-18.\\n@@\\n-This is a candidate, not an accepted release. The installed-RC gates — platform and lifecycle evidence, the fifteen-cell manual terminal matrix, provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — remain outstanding for this artifact. Passing source CI does not satisfy them.\\n+This is a candidate, not an accepted release. The installed-RC gates — platform and lifecycle evidence, mandatory automated CI PTY (§5.1) and scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2), provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — remain outstanding for this artifact. The manual matrix (§5.3) is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20; this does not waive steering, accessibility, or any other release gate. Passing source CI does not satisfy installed-RC qualification.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18894-e451-7fe2-b11c-0a0394ebbc6f","create_time":1793292974.5844493}}}
