xact head 82b17a31ff79a1e4dd64efe0a8dfdec56d3872d8 run 40895499644 remains in progress in Node22/24 npm CLI tests; JS/TS and CodeQL passed., authoritative_main=origin/main 7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760; exact-head CI run 40910552951: Node 22 and Node 24 passed; Linux x86_64 still in progress. CodeQL 40910552720 passed., pr318_state=Remote PR #318 remains stale at 1682dcb on base 14be4b8 and exact checks failed Node 22/24 plus Entire. Local rebased candidate now at 9ddb205; full make test claimed in separate worktree and active. Do not overlap., local_targeted_validation=Focused eval_integrity + eval_hardened attempt produced 47/47 PASS, but rebase changed source during that run; treat as non-exact/non-authoritative. The initial failed attempts were caused by long TMPDIR Unix socket paths and local group-writable helper mode, corrected locally. Need exact immutable candidate validation and CI., acceptance=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC and no stable v1.0.0 release verified. Latest published prerelease remains RC10; held-out T2/T3 acceptance, exact-RC checks and qualification remain open., updated 19 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Complete Nexus Code v1.0.0 release gates (current_branch=codex/v1-manual-terminal-waiver-20261029; evaluator PR branch v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds, current_head=main 078f12b11f32ebde7a28477cddba1b68e5206ca4; PR324 965667501f87c26f164646e52b8633812518e8a5; PR318 76c9bfe8e509b00e85611b684d53d135f4917366, current_pr=324, 318, focused_validation=44/44 focused tests passed on preceding worktree diff; synthetic Bubblewrap test confirms resolved-target masking blocks execution., next_action=Monitor exact-head checks; finish eligible source fixes and qualification gates without entering custodian-only payloads. Manual 5x3 waived; automated and scripted PTY gates remain required., exact_head_ci=PR324 Node 22, Node 24, JS/TS running; PR318 Node 22/24 and Entire Gates running; PR318 JS/TS and CodeQL passed, acceptance=IN_PROGRESS, release_status=R