l terminal matrix, provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — remain outstanding for this artifact. Passing source CI does not satisfy them.\n+This is a candidate, not an accepted release. The installed-RC gates — platform and lifecycle evidence, mandatory automated CI PTY (§5.1) and scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2), provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — remain outstanding for this artifact. The manual matrix (§5.3) is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20; this does not waive steering, accessibility, or any other release gate. Passing source CI does not satisfy installed-RC qualification.\n{\n  \"agent\": \"OlivePeak\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"codex/rc11-dec20-release-notes\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc11-dec20-release-notes\",\n  \"base\": \"7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760\",\n  \"head\": \"801d4470cc4f7ef981999f3c75023ffdd706d2d0\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T16:56:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Correct only RC11 release-note statements that contradict accepted DEC-20; keep §5.1 and §5.2 mandatory and do not claim qualification passes. Documentation-only; no product or held-out changes.\",\n  \"status\": \"PR #327 open; exact-head CI queued/in progress; awaiting checks and independent review\",\n  \"validation_status\": \"git diff --check PASS; behavioral tests not applicable to documentation-only edit\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":670693614}},"started_at_ms":1793293578328,"completed_at_ms":1793293578999}}
