{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:06:45.588Z","ordinal":493249,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1889d-bec2-7bc0-bdf5-e197ccf19111","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-0d04c150-c600-4a46-8ffd-5d3dfede3359","process_id":"78010","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh api repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commits/4c8afc0b99d819620fe00875da5548dbcfad9c3e/check-runs --jq '.check_runs[] | select(.name==\"Entire Gates\") | {name,conclusion,details_url,output}'; gh pr view 325 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json author,assignees,body,headRefName; rg -l 'PR.?325|E2|evidence.*Debian' .git/nexus-claims"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh api repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commits/4c8afc0b99d819620fe00875da5548dbcfad9c3e/check-runs --jq '.check_runs[] | select(.name==\"Entire Gates\") | {name,conclusion,details_url,output}'; gh pr view 325 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json author,assignees,body,headRefName; rg -l 'PR.?325|E2|evidence.*Debian' .git/nexus-claims"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"details_url\":\"https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/40/changes/nexus-code/40\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"output\":{\"annotations_count\":0,\"annotations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/check-runs/123577233960/annotations\",\"summary\":\"- ❌ **Approvals**: failed — No reviewers have approved this trail\\n- ✅ **Checks**: passed — CI checks have passed\\n- ✅ **Findings**: passed — Agent review found no blocking issues\\n- ✅ **Up to date**: passed — Up to date\\n\\n[Trail #40 on Entire](https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/40/changes/nexus-code/40)\",\"text\":null,\"title\":\"1 blocking gate not passing\"}}\n{\"assignees\":[],\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/40/changes/nexus-code/40\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\nCloses two RC10 E2 gaps and corrects one unsatisfiable claim.\\n\\n- **Provenance attestation:** `gh attestation verify` exits 0 on the published RC10 archive (SHA-256 `444d0812…`), with a Sigstore bundle; the record names the verified issuer/workflow/source commit and notes that only the archive (not `install.sh`) is attested.\\n- **Lifecycle:** the installer-driven alpha.2→RC10→alpha.2→RC10→repair→uninstall lifecycle now also runs on Debian 12 and Fedora 40 / Node 22; both PASS, with image/OS recorded in each log.\\n- **Correction:** alpha.2 has no `nexus upgrade` command, so an “ordinary upgrade from alpha.2” is not executable; the acceptance row is installer-driven. Incompatible downgrade needs a synthetic candidate because every published RC declares state schema 2.\\n- README scope/result/date updated; `SHA256SUMS` regenerated and all 50 entries verify.\\n\\nNo product code change; power loss, synthetic-journal recovery, incompatible downgrade and staging cleanup remain explicitly open.\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/e2-rc10-closeout-20261029\"}\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.10_platform-e2_lifecycle_debian-12-node22-lifecycle.sh/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.10_platform-e2_README.md/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.10_platform-e2/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/FEATURE_RC10_E2_CLOSEOUT_20261029/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.10_platform-e2_lifecycle_fedora-40-node22-lifecycle.sh/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.10_platform-e2_SHA256SUMS/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/QUAL_RC10_E2_ARCHIVE_REPAIR_20261027/owner.json\n.git/nexus-claims/archived/QUAL_E2_ENVIRONM