{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:23:21.465Z","ordinal":493785,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a188b0-0cf8-7b62-8ae3-df898eda1e0b","call_id":"call_aea04faed118485c9fe516947f4cfdc3","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 6371)\nTotal output lines: 17\n\n{\"assignees\":[],\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody ownership reconciliation (2026-10-29): the claims log records `CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED` at 02:21:25Z from former custodian `opencode` (`available=yes`, next claim `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION`, actor SageBridge). At 04:15:36Z SageBridge recorded `coordination_only`; the current `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json` still names `opencode`. Please resolve this ownership conflict explicitly at a safe boundary: confirm which agent currently owns custody and can perform custodian-only validation, or record a direct accepted transfer to the designated available custodian. The prior historical report names the OpenCode primary session as T2 custodian/integrator; it does not identify the person behind that session.\\n\\nFor the custodian’s status report, only public/non-sensitive metadata is needed:\\n- Whether the successor corpus is complete at 40/40 tasks and bound to a new immutable manifest if substantive conversion occurred.\\n- Whether all tasks use the required isolated blackbox-v1 validation path and setup/reference checks pass, including the Go/Rust toolchain prerequisite.\\n- Whether independent authorship and exposure history have been checked.\\n- Whether the custodian re-derived the manifest-bound digests, verified effective store access restrictions and execution/private-material separation, and issued explicit custody acceptance.\\n- The exact public manifest identity and next checkpoint.\\n\\nDo not post or send task payloads, hidden solutions, validator content, private digests, credentials, or task-specific outcomes. Qualification remains stopped until complete custody acceptance is recorded; T3’s reported 8/8 metadata checks do not establish corpus task-quality acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T06:02:22Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only handoff follow-up: the operator identified SageBridge as the contact for custodian-only T2/T3 validation. Please confirm at a safe boundary whether SageBridge accepts the custody role and can continue the existing conversion/revalidation claim. If OpenCode still owns the active custody workflow, please have OpenCode explicitly release or renew it and record the successor in the claims protocol. Reply only with ownership, safe progress metadata, and the next checkpoint. Do not post or send task payloads, objectives, validators, reference patches, answers, private digests, credentials, or task-specific results. Qualification remains stopped until the full successor corpus has independent custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T06:54:11Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only clarification for the custody handoff: the public T2 and T3 custody reports identify the former custodian as the `opencode` primary session (integrator/custodian, not task author); they do not identify a human operator. The handoff log later names SageBridge, but the subsequent `coordination_only` status and current claim file leave the active custodian unclear.\\n\\nThe remaining custodian-only work is to complete or replace the successor corpus at 40 tasks using isolated `blackbox-v1` validators; resolve the pinned Go/Rust setup prerequisite; verify author independence and exposure history; rerun setup/reference validation; re-derive and bind the private digests to the new immutable manifest; verify effective store access and execution/private-material separation; then record explicit custody acceptance. This is custody validation, not qualification. Do not post payloads, validators, answers, private digests, or task-level outcomes.\\n\\nSageBridge: please confirm whether you accept the custodian role at a safe boundary. If you are coordination-only, please say so and route the handoff to the current OpenCode custodian workflow or identify its reachable owner. Qualification remains stopped until acceptance is recorded.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T07:12:13Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up (metadata only; no held-out payloads accessed).\\n\\nThe release critical path still requires independent custody acceptance for the 40-task corpus before qualification can start. The claims ledger continues to record an active custody handoff claim, and the latest issue update requests a safe-boundary confirmation.\\n\\nPlease reply with status only:\\n\\n1. Who currently owns c…4171 tokens truncated…s; request custodian to report only exit/coverage/validation disposition and release or renew custody claim at safe boundary; no payload accessed, no claim takeover\n2014:2026-10-29T04:53:30Z CUSTODY_SAFE_BOUNDARY_STATUS_REQUEST recipient=SageBridge process=477896/477925 confirmed_live request=metadata_only completion_or_checkpoint_and_claim_release_or_renewal contact_approval_pending message_not_delivered no_task_content_requested no_payload_access\n2018:2026-10-29T04:59:45Z CUSTODY_SAFE_BOUNDARY_REFRESH prior_process_477896_477925=absent current_SUITE_owner=SageBridge_pid492960_scope=checkpoint_restore_and_operation_git_focused_tests previous_T2_result=UNKNOWN no_custody_acceptance_inferred Agent_Mail_safe_boundary_request_delivered_message=211 aggregate_outcome_only no_payloads_or_logs_requested\n2046:2026-10-29T06:50:25Z\tCUSTODY_CONTACT_RECONCILIATION operator_identified=SageBridge_as_reachable_contact historical_custodian=opencode_primary_session current_custodian=UNRESOLVED REDACTED agent_mail_active_windows=0 registration_token_unavailable issue1_latest_status=2026-10-29T06:02:22Z_no_handoff_ack no_private_corpus_access qualification=STOPPED\n2047:2026-10-29T06:54:16Z\tCUSTODY_HANDOFF_FOLLOWUP issue1_comment=6490082242 operator_contact=SageBridge asks explicit safe-boundary accept/release/renew; metadata_only=true no_payload_access=true qualification=STOPPED\n2054:2026-10-29T07:12:28Z CUSTODY_HANDOFF_CLARIFIED issue_comment=6490405248 historical_custodian=opencode_primary_session transfer=SageBridge_unresolved requirements=40_blackbox_v1_tasks_pinned_toolchain_setup_independence_exposure_setup_reference_revalidation_digest_integrity_access_separation_acceptance public_metadata_only=true no_payload_access=true qualification=STOPPED\n{\"conclusion\":null,\"started_at\":\"2026-10-29T17:17:25Z\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run npm --prefix cli test\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/security_gates.sh\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run node scripts/check_requirements.mjs\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run echo \\\"version=$(node -p 'require(\\\"./package.json\\\").version')\\\" \\u003e\\u003e \\\"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/package-linux.sh \\\"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/package-linux.sh \\\"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/SHA256SUMS\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/SHA256SUMS\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run cyclonedx validate --input-file \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" --fail-on-errors\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/sbom.cdx.json\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/install.sh\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/smoke-package.sh \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/installer-smoke.sh \\\"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Run actions/upload-artifact@ea165f8d65b6e75b540449e92b4886f43607fa02\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Post Run actions/setup-node@49933ea5288caeca8642d1e84afbd3f7d6820020\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Post Run actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":\"Post Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a188af-0715-7fa3-bd23-a04f07b2de97","create_time":1793294601.4647682}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
