n independent reviewer with a separate authorized Entire identity must review each exact head and submit the trail approvals: `40` on `v1/e2-rc10-closeout-20261029`, and `42` on `codex/rc11-dec20-release-notes`. The previously recorded ACCEPT for PR #325’s evidence review remains unchanged; it is not an Entire approval.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a188b4-bcfd-7801-8430-e45b95efb101","create_time":1793295092.5608234}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
