a5fe8676a0a30ea9f6e023147ad73a5 passed Node22, Node24, Linux package/repro/smoke, and CodeQL; independent review ACCEPT. Human terminal worksheet remains 0/15; scripted accessibility remains partial, no acceptance claim.\",\n  \"independent_review\": \"ACCEPT by plan05_readonly_review on exact commit 97e3f72e4a5fe8676a0a30ea9f6e023147ad73a5 versus d2442b0e0aa143191ab5ae478bc243ecce97861e.\",\n  \"review_disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n  \"reviewed_at\": \"2026-10-27T06:31Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-27T12:39:15Z\",\n  \"released_at\": \"2026-10-27T12:39:15Z\"\n}\n--- .git/nexus-claims/FILE_scripts_terminal-acceptance_run-cell.sh/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/term-screenshot-optional\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional\",\n  \"base\": \"6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T05:35:40.551514Z\",\n  \"pid\": 866174,\n  \"scope\": \"Make screenshot evidence optional under DEC-18; preserve manual checks and outcome evidence.\"\n}\n--- .git/nexus-claims/FILE_scripts_terminal-acceptance_test-scope-procs.sh/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/term-screenshot-optional\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional\",\n  \"base\": \"6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T05:35:40.551514Z\",\n  \"pid\": 866174,\n  \"scope\": \"Update regression fixtures for screenshot-optional terminal acceptance records.\"\n}\n--- .git/nexus-claims/TERMINAL_SCREENSHOT_OPTIONALITY_20261029/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/term-screenshot-optional\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional\",\n  \"base\": \"6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T05:35:40.551514Z\",\n  \"pid\": 866174,\n  \"scope\": \"Align terminal acceptance runner, summarizer and operator instructions with DEC-18 screenshot-artifact waiver while retaining all 15 interactive checks, measurements, verdicts and safety gates.\",\n  \"head\": \"2124538d21b84454319c5485140b266f11510a5a\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-29T05:48:00Z\",\n  \"status\": \"Committed reviewed runner/summarizer/docs/test correction. Focused scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh passed on exact content; diff-check, bash -n, node --check pass; requirements enforcement passes (123 rows; 12 exact-RC deferrals); sync-version confirms rc.10. Independent reviewer ACCEPT exact cumulative diff SHA256 1119aa8df5b656d3964f7f014118917648ede96516dd208a64da5ebd7e886074. Ready to push/open PR and await exact-head CI.\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":36775}},"started_at_ms":1793295216795,"completed_at_ms":1793295216795}}
