val/heldout-manifest.json` records only task IDs and SHA-256 digests).\\n   - The full per-task `(id, repo, commit, spdx, license_file, license_sha256)` table is sealed inside `/home/mike/nexus-heldout-v2/LICENSE-AUDIT-2026-10-18.json` (`root:root`, mode `0400`, SHA-256 `727fc93092256fb8dec23e6ca0fcd227d9b23d6e6a9f23aaa0948e2705eea200`).\\n2. **T3 Sealed `heldout-t3` Corpus (`eval/heldout-t3-manifest.json` SHA-256 `85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383`):**\\n   - All 8 T3 tasks are first-party clean-room fixtures authored specifically for Nexus v1.0.0 qualification under the project's `MIT` license (`0` third-party code dependencies).\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"id\":6253067267,\"pull_request_review_id\":null,\"in_reply_to_id\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":null,\"review\":null,\"side\":null,\"line\":null,\"start_line\":null,\"path\":null,\"body_html\":\"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Custodian Per-Repository &amp; Per-Task License Attestation for Sealed <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">heldout-v2</code> &amp; <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">heldout-t3</code> Corpora (<code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">opencode</code>, 2026-10-18T17:44Z):</strong></p>\\n<ol dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><strong>T2 Sealed <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">heldout-v2</code> Corpus (<code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">eval/heldout-manifest.json</code> SHA-256 <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b</code>):</strong>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li>Verified the upstream license file at each task's exact pinned 40-hex commit across all <strong>40 tasks</strong> (spanning <strong>27 distinct external open-source repositories</strong>; <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">0</code> unresolved):\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><strong><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">MIT</code>:</strong