16:07 record mislabeled the owner. Claim remains with codex-root and current working patch is untested; exact-head SUITE snapshot still active.\n2026-10-29T16:24:54Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=MAIN_ADVANCE_7fad87d0\tpr=326\tmerge_sha=7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760\tcodeql=40910552720_SUCCESS\tcargo_deny=advisories_ok_licenses_ok\tstatus=VERIFIED\n2026-10-29T16:26:33Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=REVIEW_PR325_ACCEPT\tpr=325\thead=4c8afc0b99d819620fe00875da5548dbcfad9c3e\tbase=7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760\tdiff_sha256=6f67cc192364ff2a113cd5af83fc1a5358048da958f82b7b3ca13b21cb41a4b3\tcomment=6502331242\tcodeql=40910605376_SUCCESS\tnotes=rebased_on_7fad87d0\n2026-10-29T16:51:06Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=CLAIM_ACQUIRE\tclaim=SUITE\tpr=318\thead=9ddb20599c0c95eeedec3e513bb5224d916d657d\n2026-10-29T16:56:19Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=CLAIM_RELEASE\tclaim=SUITE\tpr=318\thead=9ddb20599c0c95eeedec3e513bb5224d916d657d\n2026-10-29T17:00:35Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=REVIEW_PR318_ACCEPT\tpr=318\thead=9ddb20599c0c95eeedec3e513bb5224d916d657d\tbase=7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760\tdiff_sha256=3bce728da50148723dcbe5b119628c1a1d2edf4b4acf74ffe080be25ef886b8f\tcomment=6503116458\tcodeql=40915320653_SUCCESS\tremediation=parallel_scan_roots_concurrently\n2026-10-29T17:04:52Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=MAIN_POSTMERGE_CI_SUCCESS\tsha=7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760\trun=40910552951\ttest_matrix_22=SUCCESS\ttest_matrix_24=SUCCESS\tlinux_x86_64=SUCCESS\tstatus=FULLY_QUALIFIED\n2026-10-29T17:11:03Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=CI_PR325_SUCCESS\tpr=325\thead=4c8afc0b99d819620fe00875da5548dbcfad9c3e\trun=40910605532\ttest_matrix_22=SUCCESS\ttest_matrix_24=SUCCESS\tlinux_x86_64=SUCCESS\tstatus=READY_FOR_MERGE\n2026-10-29T17:15:24Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=REVIEW_PR318_ACTION_REQUIRED\tpr=318\thead=9ddb20599c0c95eeedec3e513bb5224d916d657d\tcomment=6503446828\tci_run=40915320865_FAILURE\tfinding=TIMEOUT_MS_25000_trips_on_usr_share_lname_traversal_in_test_matrix_22_24\n2026-10-29T17:20:22Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=MAIN_ADVANCE_fe1c91d\tpr=325\tmerge_sha=fe1c91dbcb56693a34c06dd3719bea139f639833\tcodeql=40919651757_SUCCESS\tsha256sums=50_of_50_PASS\tstatus=VERIFIED\n2026-10-29T17:22:04Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=REVIEW_PR327_ACCEPT\tpr=327\thead=801d4470cc4f7ef981999f3c75023ffdd706d2d0\tbase=7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760\tdiff_sha256=c7aca1bb41875abbd184ef1cd59f546895a0fd881d2429e12d4ac26915af3e34\tcomment=6503588763\tcodeql=40916540578_SUCCESS\tnotes=dec20_release_notes_alignment\n2026-10-29T17:45:07Z\tagent=antigravity-47e461b3\tevent=CI_PR327_SUCCESS\tpr=327\thead=801d4470cc4f7ef981999f3c75023ffdd706d2d0\trun=40916540538\ttest_matrix_22=SUCCESS\ttest_matrix_24=SUCCESS\tlinux_x86_64=SUCCESS\tstatus=READY_FOR_MERGE\n2026-10-29T17:49:00Z PR318_UTF8_FOLLOWUP commit=064244fa pushed=true REDACTED focused_test=PASS_provisional_due_concurrent_suite exact_head_CI=RUNNING heldout=NOT_ACCESSED\n{\"assignees\":[],\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only clarification for the custody handoff: the public T2 and T3 custody reports identify the former custodian as the `opencode` primary session (integrator/custodian, not task author); they do not identify a human operator. The handoff log later names SageBridge, but the subsequent `coordination_only` status and current claim file leave the active custodian unclear.\\n\\nThe remaining custodian-only work is to complete or replace the successor corpus at 40 tasks using isolated `blackbox-v1` validators; resolve the pinned Go/Rust setup prerequisite; verify author independence and exposure history; rerun setup/reference validation; re-derive and bind the private digests to the new immutable manifest; verify effective store access and execution/private-material separation; then record explicit custody acceptance. This is custody validation, not qualification. Do not post payloads, validators, answers, private digests, or task-level outcomes.\\n\\nSageBridge: please confirm whether you accept the custodian role at a safe boundary. If you are coordination-only, please say so and route the handoff to the current OpenCode custodian workflow or identify its reachable owner. Qualification remains stopped until acceptance is recorded.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T07:12:13Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up (metadata only; no held-out payloads accessed).\\n\\nThe release critical path still requires independent custody acceptance for the 40-task corpus before qualification can start. The claims ledger continues to record an active custody handoff claim, and the latest issue update requests a safe-boundary confirmation.\\n\\nPlease reply with status only:\\n\\n1. Who currently owns corpus authorship and custody?\\n2. How many tasks are complete, validated, and ready for custody review?\\n3. Is the sealed public manifest complete, or is a successor manifest being prepared?\\n4. Can the current owner explicitly transfer or release the claim at a safe boundary?\\n5. What remains before the custodian can record acceptance?\\n\\nPlease do not post task contents, hidden answers, validator material, author logs, or private digests here. Coordinate those details only through the approved custody channel.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T12:59:35Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody handoff update (no private task material accessed).\\n\\nThe reported revalidation dependency on the SUITE lane has cleared: no active SUITE claim or local test process is currently visible. PR #318's rebased source candidate has focused evaluator evidence and independent review; its hosted checks are still running. No held-out qualification was started.\\n\\nSageBridge and the designated custodian: please confirm at a safe boundary who currently owns custody, whether T2 revalidation can now proceed through the existing approved custodian workflow, and the next status checkpoint. Please release or renew the custody claim explicitly. Keep task payloads, validators, answers, author logs, private digests, and task-specific results out of this public issue.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T16:51:28Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release coordinator status request (2026-10-29; public metadata only; no private corpus material accessed): the latest custody claim metadata reports 20/40 T2 tasks built and no fresh T2 custody acceptance. T3 metadata is reported 8/8, but fresh custody acceptance remains unverified. The current integration is `fe1c91dbcb56693a34c06dd3719bea139f639833`; no held-out qualification has started.\\n\\nPlease have the designated custodian acknowledge the current owner and provide a metadata-only progress update. To unblock the release, either complete the remaining task authoring and custodian-only validation, or explicitly hand off the custody claim to an independent custodian who can do so. Do not post payloads, hidden answers, private validators, author logs, or sensitive digests here. No changes to the sealed corpus are authorized through this status request.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:35:39Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:35:39Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":498869160}},"started_at_ms":1793296157921,"completed_at_ms":1793296159420}}
