{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:50:54.809Z","ordinal":495041,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a188b4-bcfd-7801-8430-e45b95efb101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae3877d948881a0a5ab719f58d28412","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Confirmed. For v1.0.0, the manual 5×3 terminal matrix (§5.3) is **waived** under DEC-20. It is recorded as waived, not passed. The automated CI PTY (§5.1) and installed-RC scripted PTY (§5.2) remain mandatory.\n\nPR #318’s invalid UTF-8 scanner fix is pushed at `064244fa`. Independent review accepted the change; its exact-head CI is still running. The local full-suite run is also active on an older snapshot, so I have not started overlapping tests.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. Held-out custody is still unresolved, and the latest public release remains RC10; there is no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release yet."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793296253616,"completed_at_ms":1793296254809}}
