{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:51:55.418Z","ordinal":495045,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a188b4-bcfd-7801-8430-e45b95efb101","turn_id":"01a188b4-bcfd-7801-8430-e45b95efb101","last_agent_message":"Confirmed. For v1.0.0, the manual 5×3 terminal matrix (§5.3) is **waived** under DEC-20. It is recorded as waived, not passed. The automated CI PTY (§5.1) and installed-RC scripted PTY (§5.2) remain mandatory.\n\nPR #318’s invalid UTF-8 scanner fix is pushed at `064244fa`. Independent review accepted the change; its exact-head CI is still running. The local full-suite run is also active on an older snapshot, so I have not started overlapping tests.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. Held-out custody is still unresolved, and the latest public release remains RC10; there is no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release yet.","started_at":1793294908,"completed_at":1793296315,"duration_ms":1406713,"time_to_first_token_ms":3591}}
