{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:55:02.215Z","ordinal":495185,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae38873255881a09040649ab96bbe0d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_127ffa5bfee740acbf275fe2b7b3f91f","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"v1_release\",fields:{pr318_validation:\"Exact pushed head 064244fa7e05a4c43405d9782224e13757f5714e: `node cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts` passed 31/31 in 57.5s under the SUITE claim with isolated temporary test HOME/TMPDIR; claim released and logged.\",pr318_ci:\"Exact head 064244fa CI run 40924670205: Node22/24 CLI tests in progress; JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire pending.\",main_ci:\"Exact main fe1c91db run 40919652186: Node22/24 passed; Linux x86_64 advanced through CLI tests and is now in reproducible package build step, still in progress.\",pr318_review:\"Independent static review ACCEPT for cumulative content base fe1c91db..064244fa, including root enumeration cancellation/reaping and scanner output UTF-8 fail-closed fix; reviewer did not run tests.\",suite_history:\"Long local suite on old snapshot 9ddb205 ended. Claims log contains conflicting result entries: one reports FAIL for missing cargo-cyclonedx/evaluator scan timeout; later says no captured exit/output and result UNKNOWN. Do not treat it as current-head evidence. Exact PR CI remains authoritative.\",acceptance:\"IN_PROGRESS; §5.3 manual terminal matrix waived by DEC-20; §5.1 and §5.2 still mandatory. Custodian acceptance and exact-RC qualification remain incomplete.\",next_action:\"Wait for exact PR318 CI and main Linux packaging conclusion. If PR checks pass, rebase/merge through authorized process; then construct successor RC only after pre-RC gates and continue installed-RC qualification. Keep held-out qualification stopped pending custodian acceptance.\"}});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a188ca-3438-