ce. These are incomplete host-fixture checks, not a passing suite or a demonstrated source regression. The complete output is retained at `/var/tmp/nexus-pr268-make-test-9344df5.log`. Current exact-main hosted CI is still running the full CLI suite with its configured cgroups and capped tmpfs.\n\n**Release and acceptance gates:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains a prerelease; stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. The human real-terminal matrix remains 0/15; the user's report of rendering at 43×13 in tmux on GNOME Terminal is not the full matrix and had no captured screenshots. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN, last updated 2026-10-26 17:37:53 UTC, with no recorded custodian acceptance. T2/T3/T4, live provider/standalone, independent exact-RC, and human acceptance gates remain incomplete. Publication authorization remains gated on all required acceptance.\n\nThe 12:42 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence and superseded for current branch, CI, and test status by this checkpoint.\n\n## Historical terminal cancellation checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 02:11 UTC)\n\nFive targeted synthetic installed-RC10 cancellation rechecks at `TERM=dumb`, 100×30 completed with Esc delays from 0 to 1 second; idle return measured 0.405–0.507 seconds. The two earlier full-matrix timeouts remained valid and unresolved; this targeted recheck did not promote ACC-TUI-A11Y or E3. Evidence and raw PTY streams are preserved in [the cancellation timing recheck](../reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/README.md). Human terminal acceptance remained 0/15. This historical record is retained from the PR #264 merge history.\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 12:42 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and CI:** `origin/main` is `1d9357ee63b1066a891584a898842814de614fbf`, which integrates PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264). PR #264 merged at 12:38:40 UTC after exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) passed its Node 22, Node 24, and Linux package/reproducibility jobs, and CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed. New post-merge main CI [40505388775](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388775) and CodeQL [40505388849](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388849) are still running on exact commit `1d9357e`; their results are not yet established. PR #264 is merged, not open.\n\n**Readiness PR:** PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains open remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4`. The local claimed candidate `9344df578f8a39a55d82ead0f15c4811864d21f8` has not passed final-base independent review: the reviewer correctly found its current PR/CI statement stale after PR #264 merged. This checkpoint corrects that statement; the candidate requires fresh exact-head independent review and then owner push and hosted checks. No merge is claimed.\n\n**RC8 dogfood export disposition:** The export `/home/mike/nexus-code/nexus-session-session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn.json` (session `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn`, created 2026-10-26 17:07:51 UTC) records the workspace `/home/mike/nexus-code`, 28 model-written exploratory findings, `candidateId`/candidate identity absent, zero validation receipts, and `unverifiedChangesPending=true`. Its task outcome is `VERIFIER_FAILED`: the configured `make test` verifier exited unsuccessfully because it could not establish the required matching pre-change baseline; `hasExecutedTests=false`, so this export does not report a test failure or test pass. The full trace shows one workspace write, `docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md`; the shared checkout copy remains untracked and untouched. Treat the 28 findings as hypotheses pending reproduction, not verified defects, completed remediation, or acceptance evidence.\n\n**Candidate and gates:** The latest public release remains prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` with archive SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. Stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. The required real-terminal matrix remains **0/15**; scripted terminal evidence does not replace operator evidence. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) has no recorded custodian acceptance; no private payload was accessed or run. T2/T3/T4, exact-current-RC provider/standalone and cross-runner qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization is granted but gated. The distribution target is the GitHub installer; npm publication is inapplicable.\n\nThe 11:58 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence and superseded for current source, PR, CI and acceptance state by this checkpoint.\n\n---\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 11:58 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source:** `origin/main` is `d2442b0e0aa143191ab5ae478bc243ecce97861e`, which integrates PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266). Post-merge CI [40461301453](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40461301453) and CodeQL [40461301693](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40461301693) both completed successfully. PR #266 exact-head CI, including Node 22, Node 24, Linux tests/package and reproducibility, and CodeQL passed before merge. The source and its local regressions are integrated; this does not qualify the already-published RC10 artifact.\n\n**Current release PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264) is open at `97e3f72e4a5fe8676a0a30ea9f6e023147ad73a5` on current base `d2442b0`; CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed and exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) is still running. PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on the previous `303ea32` source. Its earlier CI and CodeQL passed on that older head. A local readiness candidate has been refreshed to `d2442b0`; requirement enforcement (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), RC10 version synchronization, and diff hygiene pass on the refreshed candidate. Independent review asked that the old 05:54 snapshot be clearly superseded; this checkpoint does so. The refreshed candidate still needs final-base review, owner push, and exact-head hosted checks.\n\n**Installed RC and qualification:** The latest public release remains prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` with archive SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. No stable `v1.0.0` release appears among the current public releases. The human five-terminal, three-size matrix remains **0/15**; scripted terminal evidence is partial and does not replace the operator matrix. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) has no custodian response to the latest metadata-only request (2026-10-26); no held-out payload was accessed or run. T2/T3/T4, standalone/provider qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete.\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 mike mike 4096 Oct 29 16:28 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"program