rs)\\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check`: **PASS** (`all components at 1.0.0-rc.11`)\\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: **PASS** (`123 rows; tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7`)\\n- GitHub Actions `CodeQL` ([`40916540578`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40916540578)): **SUCCESS** (`1m2s`)\\n- GitHub Actions `CI` ([`40916540538`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40916540538)): `test-matrix (22)` and `test-matrix (24)` completed **SUCCESS**; `linux-x86_64` in progress\\n\\n**Verdict**: **ACCEPT** (`801d4470cc4f7ef981999f3c75023ffdd706d2d0`).\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:21:37Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**claude-code independent review — ACCEPT** at exact head `801d4470cc4f7ef981999f3c75023ffdd706d2d0` (base `7fad87d0d8ccdabcf7b8153893e04274d2ab5760`). This is a read-only docs review; I ran no tests.\\n\\nBoth lines I flagged on #324 now match DEC-20 and the owner's decision.\\n- Line 33 says the §5.3 matrix is waived by DEC-20, with no runs, verdicts or evidence required or claimed. It says §5.1 and §5.2 stay mandatory, and that DEC-18 covers screenshots separately.\\n- Line 49 lists §5.1 and §5.2 among the outstanding installed-RC gates, and says the waiver does not cover steering, accessibility or any other gate.\\n\\nNothing in it claims that a cell passed. The only file changed is `docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.11.md`, which has no conflict with current main `fe1c91db` (merge-tree is clean, and #325 didn't touch `docs/releases/`).\\n\\nCI at this head, as of 2026-10-29T17:23:32Z: Node 22 COMPLETED/SUCCESS, Node 24 COMPLETED/SUCCESS, JS/TS COMPLETED/SUCCESS, CodeQL COMPLETED/SUCCESS. **linux-x86_64 IN_PROGRESS.** This ACCEPT does not authorize a merge until linux-x86_64 reports completed/success.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:23:33Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### CI Verification Complete — **READY FOR MERGE**\\n\\n- **PR**: #327 (`docs(release): align RC11 notes with DEC-20`)\\n- **Head SHA**: `801d4470cc4f7ef981999f3c75023ffdd706d2d0`\\n- **GitHub Actions CI Run**: [`40916540538`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40916540538) — **SUCCESS** (100% pass)\\n  - `test-matrix (22)`: **SUCCESS** (19m37s)\\n  - `test-matrix (24)`: **SUCCESS** (20m28s)\\n  - `linux-x86_64`: **SUCCESS** (23m13s)\\n    - Step 12 (`cargo deny`): **PASS** (`advisories ok, licenses ok`)\\n    - Step 19 (`npm --prefix cli test`): **PASS**\\n    - Step 20 (`npm --prefix cli run test:smoke`): **PASS**\\n    - Step 21 (`cargo test --release`): **PASS**\\n    - Steps 23–24 (`package-linux.sh` dist \\u0026 repro-check): **PASS**\\n    - Steps 25–30 (reproducible comparison checks): **PASS** (tarball, SHA256SUMS, SBOM, notices, installer bit-for-bit identical)\\n    - Steps 31–32 (package-smoke \\u0026 installer-smoke): **PASS**\\n- **CodeQL Run**: [`40916540578`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40916540578) — **SUCCESS** (1m2s)\\n\\nPR #327 is clean, verified, and ready for owner landing.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:44:28Z\"}]\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":401095153}},"started_at_ms":1793296931958,"completed_at_ms":1793296933360}}
