{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:10:54.320Z","ordinal":495750,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a188ca-3438-7770-bdcd-730c68c81c88","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-84ea347a-3639-471b-b1df-a2a43c3d95f1","process_id":"73359","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '42,55p' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md; sed -n '180,222p' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md; rg -n 'ACC-TUI-MANUAL|§5\\.3|five.*terminal|matrix.*waiv' docs/v1.0.0 docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.11.md | head -60"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '42,55p' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md","name":"ACCEPTANCE.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '180,222p' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md","name":"ACCEPTANCE.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n \"ACC-TUI-MANUAL|§5\\\\.3|five.*terminal|matrix.*waiv\" docs/v1.0.0 docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.11.md","query":"ACC-TUI-MANUAL|§5\\.3|five.*terminal|matrix.*waiv","path":"v1.0.0"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"| REQ-AGT-010 | ACC-TRUST-04 | Independent acceptance of the DEC-04 v1 subset |\n| REQ-PRV-003 | ACC-INF-10 | Installed-RC standalone and absent-gateway behavior |\n| REQ-REL-005 | ACC-SUP-04, ACC-SUP-05 | Exact-RC security and dependency artifact checks |\n| REQ-AGT-110 | ACC-CONT-10, ACC-GOV-06 | Installed-RC continuity and independent acceptance |\n| REQ-PRV-111 | ACC-PRV-LIVE | Installed-RC provider verification |\n| REQ-REL-114 | ACC-SUP-08 | Exact-RC cross-runner reproducibility |\n| REQ-QUAL-101 | ACC-QUAL-T2 | Installed-RC held-out T2 qualification |\n| REQ-QUAL-107 | ACC-PRV-STANDALONE, ACC-PRV-LIVE | Installed-RC standalone and provider matrix |\n| REQ-QUAL-108 | ACC-TUI-STEER, ACC-TUI-A11Y, ACC-TUI-MANUAL | CI PTY checks and installed-RC real-terminal matrix |\n| REQ-QUAL-109 | ACC-QUAL-T3 | Installed-RC T3 long-task qualification |\n<!-- RC-QUALIFICATION-ONLY:END -->\n\n<!-- RC-QUALIFICATION-EXCEPTIONS:START -->\n### Approved exact-RC qualification exceptions\n|---|---|\n| s1 startup, unreachable endpoint | The endpoint is named, with a fix hint. The turn ends with guidance in ≤ 2.5 min. |\n| s2 approval under continuous typing, paste and burst, at 40×14 | No decision is made by stray input. A deliberate key decides. |\n| s3 completion | The outcome is shown in words: VERIFIED, REGRESSION_FREE or UNVERIFIED. |\n| s4–s6 cancel and steer | Cancel is acknowledged within 1 frame and idle within 5 s. Steering is applied. |\n| s7 resume | The prior conversation is shown. |\n| s8–s9 cancel or quit during a tool | Zero surviving processes. |\n| r1a / r1d REPL approvals | DENIED for a lone Enter and for a typed-ahead `y`. |\n\n### 5.3 Manual real-terminal matrix (E3)\n\nTerminals: xterm, kitty (kitty keyboard protocol on), tmux 3.x inside GNOME Terminal, VS Code integrated terminal, GNOME Terminal. Sizes: 80×24, 40×14, 200×60.\n\nFor each terminal × size, check:\n\n1. Launch `nexus` (the TUI appears).\n2. Approval panel. Type continuously across it. Paste 3 lines. Approve with a deliberate key.\n3. Shift+Enter or Alt+Enter multiline.\n4. Resize during streaming.\n5. Esc during `sleep 30` (no survivors).\n6. Ctrl-C twice (clean terminal restore: echo on, no stray escape codes).\n7. NO_COLOR.\n\nRecord PASS/FAIL per cell, with a screenshot of the approval panel and the post-exit terminal state.\n\n**Gate:** zero FAIL on checks 2, 5 and 6, which are safety checks. Other FAILs need a written disposition (fix, or a documented known limitation).\n\n## 6. Task-quality qualification (REQ-QUAL-101 to REQ-QUAL-106, REQ-QUAL-109)\n\nEnvironment: E4 (gateway direct), serial runs, with matched model fingerprint, budgets and env (REQ-QUAL-102).\n\n### 6.1 T2 held-out (ACC-QUAL-T2)\n\n- 40 sealed tasks. The manifest is committed before RC1, and authorship is recorded (agent-authored, DEC-05).\n- 5 runs × {Nexus RC, Goose, OpenCode}.\n- Before execution, freeze three qualification configs at `eval/configs/v1-t2-nexus.json`, `eval/configs/v1-t2-goose.json`, and `eval/configs/v1-t2-opencode.json`. Each must set `qualification: true`, identify the same model fingerprint and sampling settings, and record equal context/output and task budgets; the Nexus config must identify the installed RC and its package digest. Do not derive these files from the pilot configs by silently inheriting or changing settings.\n- Set `T2_TASKS` to the custodian-approved, sealed task directory and `T2_OUT` to a new, empty, run-specific output directory. Do not use the disclosed `eval/tasks` development set as held-out evidence. Preserve all three outputs and their manifests; never reuse an output directory for a retry.\n- Run each config serially, with identical task selection and five runs per task:\n\n  ```bash\n  set -euo pipefail\n  : \"${T2_TASKS:?set the sealed task directory}\"\n  : \"${T2_OUT:?set a new unique output directory}\"\nrg: docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.11.md: No such file or directory (os error 2)\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:182:- **DEC-02** is resolved: the REPL stays a supported secondary surface, so §5.3 is required.\ndocs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md:241:| REQ-QUAL-108 | Audit | PTY CI plus a manual real-terminal matrix. | terminal acceptance | `cli/test/tui_*`; ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | TEST (PTY suites in CI); UNV (real terminals) | partial | ACCEPTANCE §5 | RR | D §6 | SPEC-10 / PLAN-10 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:36:| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3. Archive screenshots. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | RC build |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:50:| REQ-QUAL-108 | ACC-TUI-STEER, ACC-TUI-A11Y, ACC-TUI-MANUAL | CI PTY checks and installed-RC real-terminal matrix |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:120:| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell passes; screenshots and per-cell verdicts are archived. |\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":28373}},"started_at_ms":1793297454320,"completed_at_ms":1793297454320}}
