terminal acceptance, package/install/reproducibility checks, and owner-supplied independent RC acceptance. [Task 1]\n   765\t- `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md` requires one worktree per slice, isolated `HOME`, claims for hot/shared files, no `pkill -f`, no concurrent gateway/full-suite runs, and owner-controlled tag/publish actions. [Task 1]\n   766\t- The readiness claims were `FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md/owner.json` and `PLAN-10_READINESS_T2/owner.json`; at handoff the owner PID was absent but the claim was younger than 24 hours. Resume after release or the documented stale-claim procedure, update against `2c70d39`, and rerun fresh branch CI. [Task 2]\n   767\t\n   768\t## Failures and how to do differently\n   769\t\n   770\t- Symptom: GitHub merge-tool schema validation fails. Cause: `repository_full_name` was omitted. Fix: provide `repository_full_name: \"mikeholownych/nexus-code\"`. [Task 1]\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":52249}},"started_at_ms":1793297639571,"completed_at_ms":1793297639572}}
