{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:14:04.772Z","ordinal":495868,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a188ca-3438-7770-bdcd-730c68c81c88","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae38ceb3bf081a0b5b7efaffa053eca","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. **The manual §5.3 matrix is waived for v1.0.0; §5.1 automated CI PTY and §5.2 installed-RC scripted PTY remain mandatory.** The waiver is already recorded in merged PR #324/DEC-20.\n\nThe current blocker is PR #318: Node 22 and 24 CI both fail when evaluator compiler-exposure scanning hits its deadline. Its full local suite is still running under the SUITE claim, so I’m preserving that run and will address the scanner once the claim is released. RC10 remains the latest published candidate; no stable v1.0.0 release is verified.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":765,"lineEnd":765,"note":"concurrency and suite ownership protocol"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"started_at_ms":1793297643265,"completed_at_ms":1793297644772}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:14:04.777Z","ordinal":495869,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae38ceb3bf081a0b5b7efaffa053eca","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Understood. **The manual §5.3 matrix is waived for v1.0.0; §5.1 automated CI PTY and §5.2 installed-RC scripted PTY remain mandatory.** The waiver is already recorded in merged PR #324/DEC-20.\n\nThe current blocker is PR #318: Node 22 and 24 CI both fail when evaluator compiler-exposure scanning hits its deadline. Its full local suite is still running under the SUITE claim, so I’m preserving that run and will address the scanner once the claim is released. RC10 remains the latest published candidate; no stable v1.0.0 release is verified.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:765-765|note=[concurrency and suite ownership protocol]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a188ca-3438-7770-bdcd-730c68c81c88","create_time":1793297643.2360559,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0e1c614dbfb55a8c016ae38ceb3bf081a0b5b7efaffa053eca","turn_id":"01a188ca-3438-7770-bdcd-730c68c81c88","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a188de-7ce8-7ab1-bcbe-dbc723ea84d9","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23151}}
