ng us a shout-out.\\n\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e❤️ Share\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cdl\\u003e\\n\\u003cdd\\u003e\\n\\n- [X](https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A\\u0026url=https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/share?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai)\\n- [Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/submit?title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit\\u0026text=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai\\u0026mini=true\\u0026title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit\\u0026summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\u003c/dl\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\n\\n\\u003csub\\u003eComment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.\\u003c/sub\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003c!-- tips_end --\\u003e\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T18:07:42Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review — `ACCEPT`\\n\\n- **PR**: #328 (`evidence(e2): assert staging cleanup and refuse an incompatible downgrade`)\\n- **Branch**: `v1/e2-rc10-gaps-20261029`\\n- **Head SHA**: `10a4d21f1df837038cf2e5f6c1e5a64d70da4046`\\n- **Base SHA (`origin/main`)**: `fe1c91dbcb56693a34c06dd3719bea139f639833`\\n- **Merge-base Diff SHA-256**: `30d94f4aea328ff5cbe6c6b640f2a421ed705d3960fdf95a21a4ef441a68d2ee` (8 files changed, +132 / -10)\\n\\n#### Audit \\u0026 Verification Summary\\n1. **Evidence Integrity \\u0026 Lifecycle Coverage**:\\n   - Closes the final two automatable RC10 E2 lifecycle gap cells in `docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/`:\\n     - **Staging Cleanup**: `lifecycle/run-process-crash-recovery.sh` asserts that `stagingDir` and any `.tmp-upgrade-*` directories are removed after `nexus upgrade --recover`, while the failed target remains for inspection. Updated log records `staging_removed=true` and `staging_cleanup_asserted=true`.\\n     - **Incompatible Downgrade Refusal**: Adds deterministic fixture generation (`lifecycle/prepare-incompatible-fixture.sh`) with state schema 1, local fixture server (`lifecycle/incompatible-server.js`), and execution script (`lifecycle/run-incompatible-downgrade.sh`). Asserts that `nexus upgrade --version v1.0.0-rc.4 --allow-downgrade --yes` is rejected with the exact state schema mismatch error and that current installed binary, package hash, and launcher link remain untouched.\\n   - Preserves truthful disclosure that power-loss durability and synthetic-journal recovery remain separate/open.\\n   - Zero product code modifications.\\n2. **Tree Invariants \\u0026 Checksums**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: PASS (0 errors).\\n   - `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check`: PASS (all components at `1.0.0-rc.11`).\\n   - `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: PASS (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals).\\n   - `sha256sum --check SHA256SUMS`: PASS (**54 of 54 entries OK**).\\n3. **Static Analysis \\u0026 CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [`40928851852`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40928851852): **SUCCESS** (1m3s).\\n   - CI Run [`40928852031`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40928852031): in progress (`test-matrix (22)` executing tests; `test-matrix (24)` flaked on runner test timeout in `cancel_ends_the_command_group`; companion run [`40927837256`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40927837256) passing cargo tests across both matrix jobs and executing npm test).\\n\\n#### Verdict\\n**`ACCEPT`**. Ready for qualification and merge upon clean completion of CI.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T18:20:25Z\"}],\"files\":[\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/README.md\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/SHA256SUMS\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/lifecycle/incompatible-server.js\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/lifecycle/prepare-incompatible-fixture.sh\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/lifecycle/run-incompatible-downgrade.sh\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/lifecycle/run-process-crash-recovery.sh\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/lifecycle/ubuntu-22-04-node22-incompatible-downgrade.log\",\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/platform-e2/ubuntu-22-04-node22-upgrade-process-crash-recovery.log\"],\"headRefOid\":\"10a4d21f1df837038cf2e5f6c1e5a64d70da4046\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T18:20:25Z\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a188f4-34f0-7702-9fc6-6c1c2c27142e","create_time":1793299163.0518522}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
