r=47_PASS_cancellation=1_PASS result=PASS\n2026-10-29T17:43:01Z RELEASE FILE_eval_isolate.mjs agent=codex-root result=NO_NET_CHANGE diagnostics_reverted exact_candidate=7fe2981d6e9a379ff06804b829cb9200fe7a8dbe\n2026-10-29T17:43:52Z LOCAL_BRANCH_SUPERSEDED name=v1/fix-libz-sys-0418-20261029 commit=d71beaf157667fa5b5728a7a71c3c4caa26269be superseded_by=PR326_head_d7997b8ad67491d6096717c6733f3b25e7172fc7 merged=7fad87d0 claim=FILE_core_Cargo.lock already_released=true worktree_clean=true no_second_PR\n2026-10-29T18:07:34Z COMMIT FEATURE_RC10_E2_GAPS_20261029 commit=05470c2c7c1829a58ebdee81bdffc0d47bfc95be parent=fe1c91dbcb56693a34c06dd3719bea139f639833; staging cleanup + incompatible downgrade PASS\n2026-10-29T18:21:00Z | codex-root | PR318 exact-head CI 40924670205 completed FAILURE on 064244fa: Node22/24 each failed npm CLI test matrix; root failure is compiler-exposure inventory preflight refusal in eval_hardened/eval_integrity after 25s scanner deadline. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Linux skipped. Full unfiltered local CLI suite PID 521509 remains active under SUITE claim, progressing; no source edits until it releases.\n2026-10-29T18:13:56Z COMMIT FEATURE_RC10_E2_GAPS_20261029 commit=10a4d21f1df837038cf2e5f6c1e5a64d70da4046; reproducible fixture + wording\n2026-10-29T18:18:53Z CLAIM_WORKTREE_UPDATE codex-root PR318: source edits moved to /home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-batch on v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-batch at 064244fa7e05a4c43405d9782224e13757f5714e; prior worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds is frozen at same SHA under active SUITE PID 521509; scanner batching and synthetic regression only, no heldout.\n2026-10-29T18:20:12Z PR318_SCANNER_BATCHING_IMPLEMENTED head=064244fa7e05a4c43405d9782224e13757f5714e worktree=/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-batch change=group immediate child directories in batches of 8, preserve full traversal and existing limits; add late-batch compiler canary fixture; static_checks=diff-check,node-check PASS; tests=queued active_SUITE_PID=521509 no heldout.\n2026-10-29T18:38:22Z SUITE_SCOPE_CORRECTION pid=521509 exact_head=064244fa7e05a4c43405d9782224e13757f5714e actual=full_unfiltered_CLI_npm_test because --test-name-pattern forwarded to test-scope-procs script; active child=sidecar.test.ts; frozen worktree; no heldout.\n2026-10-29T18:54:29Z SUITE_RESULT_UNKNOWN prior_pid=521509 head=064244fa7e05a4c43405d9782224e13757f5714e reason=processes_ended_but_exit_summary_unavailable; not counted as pass.\n2026-10-29T18:54:29Z CLAIM SUITE agent=codex-root branch=v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-batch head=064244fa7e05a4c43405d9782224e13757f5714e REDACTED\n--- active test processes ---\n 847456    6852       00:01 /usr/bin/zsh -lc common=$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir); printf '%s\\n' '--- SUITE claim ---'; if test -f \"$common/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json\"; then cat \"$common/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json\"; else echo FREE; fi; printf '%s\\n' '--- claim log tail ---'; tail -35 \"$common/nexus-claims.log\" 2>/dev/null; printf '%s\\n' '--- active test processes ---'; ps -eo pid,ppid,etime,args | rg 'run_tests|vitest|make test|eval_integrity|eval_hardened' | head -40\n 847458    6852       00:01 /usr/bin/zsh -lc git rev-parse --git-common-dir; git status --short; git rev-parse HEAD; git log -5 --oneline; git diff --stat; git diff -- eval/scan-compiler-exposure.mjs cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts\n 848331  847456       00:00 rg run_tests|vitest|make test|eval_integrity|eval_hardened\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"RESULT 2"},{"type":"input_text","text":"# Task Group: Nexus v1 CI prerequisite integration and release qualification handoff\nscope: Integrate reviewed CI prerequisites and accurately track Nexus v1 release gates, claims, and held-out boundaries; use for `v1/integration` readiness work, not as a substitute for exact-RC qualification.\napplies_to: cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code (worktree used: /home/mike/nexus-wt/p10g-rebased); reuse_rule=recheck integration HEAD, claim ownership/staleness, exact CI, acceptance documents, and release state; recorded alpha.2 status and blockers are time-specific.\n\n## Task 1: Monitor exact-head CI/reviews and merge PR #10 without calling it a release, success for integration; partial for qualification\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-16T01-45-07-stRS-t5820_assessment_and_nexus_v1_release_monitoring.md (cwd=/home/mike/Projects/aihost, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/10/16/rollout-2026-10-16T01-45-07-01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-18T01:41:41+00:00, thread_id=01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0, PR #10 integrated; qualification blocked)\n\n### keywords\n\n- Nexus v1, PR #10, bdc705e593def11ee5e44a6ebd0703b57e5953a0, CI 39085388798, v1/integration, 2c70d39ad4f9c29cff04c909eef9de6d2a29bdb2, check_requirements.mjs --enforce, REQ-QUAL-101, ACCEPTANCE.md, CONCURRENCY.md\n\n## Task 2: Record readiness status while the claim is active, success\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-16T01-45-07-stRS-t5820_assessment_and_nexus_v1_release_monitoring.md (cwd=/home/mike/Projects/aihost, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/10/16/rollout-2026-10-16T01-45-07-01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-18T01:41:41+00:00, thread_id=01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0, held-out payload preserved; readiness files untouched)\n\n### keywords\n\n- FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md, PLAN-10_READINESS_T2, nexus-claims, stale claim, 24-hour threshold, PR #9, held-out, fresh branch CI\n\n## User preferences\n\n- reviewers and the release workflow distinguish source/CI acceptance from RC/product qualification -> never call a green CI run a release. [Task 1]\n- when shared readiness/governance files are claimed, coordinate claim release or wait for the documented stale threshold; do not access held-out payloads or edit the artifact meanwhile. [Task 2]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n"}],"internal_chat_m