s historical snapshots; they do not supersede these current observations.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:381:**Custody and disposition:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open with no custodian response after the 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC metadata-only request. Public manifest metadata does not satisfy independent private custody acceptance. OpenRouter remains disconnected on the last checked Ubuntu desktop status; no E4 local gateway qualification evidence was available there. No stable `v1.0.0` release is published; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`, and existing publication authorization remains granted but gated on the required acceptance evidence.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:395:**Custody and disposition:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open with no custodian response after the 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC metadata-only request. Public manifest metadata does not satisfy independent private custody acceptance. OpenRouter remains disconnected on the last checked Ubuntu desktop status; no E4 local gateway qualification evidence was available there. No stable `v1.0.0` release is published; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`, and publication authorization remains granted but gated on all mandatory acceptance evidence.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:409:**Custody and disposition:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open with no custodian response after the 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC metadata-only request. Public manifest metadata does not satisfy independent private custody acceptance. OpenRouter remains disconnected on the last checked Ubuntu desktop status; no E4 local gateway qualification evidence was available there. No stable `v1.0.0` release is published; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`, and existing publication authorization remains granted but gated on the required acceptance evidence.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:421:**Remaining qualification and disposition:** Issue [#1](